# Each model supplies a dimensional calculation, applicable scope, measurement,
# and a real perturbation of one named parameter. Shared conservation laws are
# intentionally reused only where the course's unit calls for that quantity.
M={}
def m(k,inputs,formula,expr,unit,bound,measure,change,expr2):
    val=eval(expr,{'__builtins__':{}},{'sqrt':math.sqrt,'log10':math.log10,'exp':math.exp})
    val2=eval(expr2,{'__builtins__':{}},{'sqrt':math.sqrt,'log10':math.log10,'exp':math.exp})
    M[k]={'inputs':inputs,'formula':formula,'expression':expr,'value':val,'unit':unit,'bound':bound,'measure':measure,'change':change,'expression2':expr2,'value2':val2}

m('load','Q=2000 m³/d；C=180 mg/L~Q=2000 m³/d; C=180 mg/L','L=QC/1000','2000*180/1000','kg/d','穩定流量與流量加權濃度；瞬時樣本不代表整日。~Steady flow and flow-weighted concentration; a grab sample does not represent a day.','比對累積流量計與流量比例混合樣本。~Compare the totalizing flowmeter with a flow-proportional composite sample.','C:180→210 mg/L','2000*210/1000')
m('nload','Q=1200 m³/d；NH4-N=40 mg/L~Q=1200 m³/d; NH4-N=40 mg/L','LN=QCN/1000','1200*40/1000','kg N/d','所有氮濃度以 N 質量計；不可混用 NH4 的分子質量。~All concentrations are on an N-mass basis, not NH4 molecular mass.','校正流量與氨氮儀，保留採樣時段。~Calibrate flow and ammonium instruments and retain the sampling interval.','Q:1200→1500 m³/d','1500*40/1000')
m('pload','Q=2500 m³/d；TP=6 mg P/L~Q=2500 m³/d; TP=6 mg P/L','LP=QCP/1000','2500*6/1000','kg P/d','TP 與溶解性磷須分開；流量加權後再計算。~Separate total and dissolved phosphorus; use flow weighting.','對照總磷消化分析與過濾樣本。~Compare digested total-P analysis with filtered samples.','TP:6→8 mg P/L','2500*8/1000')
m('hrt','V=1500 m³；Q=3000 m³/d~V=1500 m³; Q=3000 m³/d','θ=24V/Q','24*1500/3000','h','名義水力停留時間；不包含短流、死角及回流的停留時間分布。~Nominal hydraulic residence time; it does not resolve short-circuiting, dead zones or recirculation residence-time distributions.','以槽有效容積與示蹤劑穿透曲線交叉檢查。~Cross-check effective volume with a tracer breakthrough curve.','Q:3000→3600 m³/d','24*1500/3600')
m('shorth','V=150 m³；Q=3600 m³/d~V=150 m³; Q=3600 m³/d','θ=24V/Q','24*150/3600','h','局部槽體的名義時間，不是生物反應完成時間。~Nominal time in one compartment, not a guarantee of biological completion.','把分區入口與出口示蹤時間畫成圖。~Plot tracer arrival at the compartment inlet and outlet.','V:150→180 m³','24*180/3600')
m('inventory','V=1500 m³；X=3 kg/m³~V=1500 m³; X=3 kg/m³','MX=VX','1500*3','kg solids','X 必須指明 MLSS 或 MLVSS；不能把懸浮固體全部當活性菌。~State whether X is MLSS or MLVSS; suspended solids are not all active biomass.','比較混合均勻後多深度的 MLSS、MLVSS 樣本。~Compare well-mixed MLSS and MLVSS samples at several depths.','X:3→3.5 kg/m³','1500*3.5')
m('fm','Q=2000 m³/d；S=0.18 kg BOD/m³；V=1500 m³；Xv=2.4 kg MLVSS/m³~Q=2000 m³/d; S=0.18 kg BOD/m³; V=1500 m³; Xv=2.4 kg MLVSS/m³','F/M=QS/(VXv)','2000*.18/(1500*2.4)','kg BOD/(kg MLVSS·d)','單一進流的平均負荷；需另看可生物降解比例與回流負荷。~Average single-inlet loading; biodegradability and recycle loads require separate assessment.','核對 BOD 樣本、MLVSS 與生物槽有效體積。~Check BOD samples, MLVSS and effective biological volume.','S:0.18→0.24 kg/m³','2000*.24/(1500*2.4)')
m('srt','固體庫存 MX=4500 kg；排泥=180 kg/d；出流水固體=20 kg/d~Solids inventory MX=4500 kg; wasting=180 kg/d; effluent solids=20 kg/d','SRT=MX/(W+E)','4500/(180+20)','d','全系統固體收支的準穩態估計；回流不是離開系統的排泥。~Quasi-steady whole-system solids balance; return sludge is not a solids exit.','從排泥流量、含固率與出流水 TSS 各算質量。~Calculate masses independently from wasting flow, solids fraction and effluent TSS.','W:180→230 kg/d','4500/(230+20)')
m('otr','kLa=4 h⁻¹；C*=8 mg/L；C=2 mg/L；V=1000 m³~kLa=4 h⁻¹; C*=8 mg/L; C=2 mg/L; V=1000 m³','OTR=kLa(C*-C)V/1000','4*(8-2)*1000/1000','kg O2/h','等溫、均勻混合的簡化傳質；kLa 已假設為污水條件。~Isothermal mixed-tank transfer; kLa is assumed to represent wastewater conditions.','比對溶氧剖面、耗氧率與尾氣推估。~Compare DO profiles, oxygen-uptake rate and off-gas estimates.','C:2→3 mg/L','4*(8-3)*1000/1000')
m('denit','NO3-N 去除量=30 kg/d；電子當量=2.86 kg COD/kg N~NO3-N removed=30 kg/d; electron equivalent=2.86 kg COD/kg N','CODmin=2.86×N','2.86*30','kg COD/d','僅硝酸鹽還原的理論電子當量；不含菌體合成、溶氧與其他耗碳。~Theoretical nitrate electron equivalent only; biomass synthesis, DO and other carbon demand are omitted.','獨立量測 NO3-N、NO2-N、可利用 COD，避免把總 COD 全算可用。~Measure NO3-N, NO2-N and available COD separately rather than treating all COD as usable.','N:30→36 kg/d','2.86*36')
m('sor','Q=3000 m³/d；A=120 m²~Q=3000 m³/d; A=120 m²','SOR=Q/A','3000/120','m/d','表面溢流率只是一個水力指標，不能單獨決定絮凝沉降效率。~Surface overflow rate is a hydraulic metric, not a complete predictor of flocculent settling.','將流量、池面積與沉降柱結果一起比較。~Compare flow and plan area with settling-column observations.','Q:3000→4200 m³/d','4200/120')
m('energy','電力 E=960 kWh/d；處理量 Q=3000 m³/d~Electricity E=960 kWh/d; flow Q=3000 m³/d','SEC=E/Q','960/3000','kWh/m³','同一系統邊界與同一日；需同時滿足出流水品質。~Use identical system boundaries and days; effluent quality must also be satisfied.','同步讀取電表、流量計與水質趨勢。~Synchronize electricity, flow and water-quality trends.','E:960→840 kWh/d','840/3000')
m('nitrite','假設 NH4-N=50 kg/d；NO2-N/NH4-N 化學計量比=1.32~Assume NH4-N=50 kg/d; nitrite/ammonium N ratio=1.32','NO2-N=1.32×NH4-N','1.32*50','kg N/d','選定的厭氧氨氧化化學計量近似，不是通用投料設定。~A selected anammox stoichiometric approximation, not a universal feeding setpoint.','把氨、亞硝酸與硝酸的氮基準量測放在同一表。~Tabulate ammonium, nitrite and nitrate measurements on the same N basis.','NH4-N:50→60 kg/d','1.32*60')
m('pnfrac','假設亞硝酸與剩餘氨氮需求比 r=1.32~Assume required nitrite-to-remaining-ammonium N ratio r=1.32','f=r/(1+r)','1.32/(1+1.32)','fraction','忽略同化與其他反應的前段部分亞硝化比例；需用實測氮收支校正。~Upstream partial-nitritation fraction ignoring assimilation and side reactions; calibrate against a measured nitrogen balance.','以進出段氮物種確認剩餘氨與所生成亞硝酸。~Check remaining ammonium and produced nitrite from inlet/outlet nitrogen species.','r:1.32→1.20','1.20/(1+1.20)')
m('nvol','N 負荷=100 kg N/d；反應容積=200 m³~N load=100 kg N/d; reactor volume=200 m³','NLR=LN/V','100/200','kg N/(m³·d)','容積負荷不能代替顆粒活性與可接受毒性資料。~Volumetric loading does not replace granule activity or inhibition data.','把體積、氮負荷、比活性與顆粒流失分列。~Record volume, N loading, specific activity and granule loss separately.','LN:100→130 kg N/d','130/200')
m('pno2','NH4-N 亞硝化=40 kg/d；理論 O2/N=3.43~NH4-N nitritation=40 kg/d; theoretical O2/N=3.43','O2=3.43×N','3.43*40','kg O2/d','僅氨氧化至亞硝酸，不含生長、異營耗氧與傳氧效率。~Ammonium-to-nitrite demand only, excluding growth, heterotrophic demand and transfer efficiency.','以 NH4-N 與 NO2-N 質量變化對照耗氧。~Compare ammonium/nitrite mass change with oxygen use.','N:40→45 kg/d','3.43*45')
m('fa','TAN=50 mg N/L；pH=7.5；假設 pKa=9.25~TAN=50 mg N/L; pH=7.5; assumed pKa=9.25','FA=TAN/(1+10^(pKa-pH))','50/(1+10**(9.25-7.5))','mg NH3-N/L','pKa 隨溫度、離子強度改變；此例不是生物抑制閾值。~pKa varies with temperature and ionic strength; this is not a biological inhibition threshold.','以校正 pH、溫度與總氨氮重算，而非直接以 TAN 判斷游離氨。~Recalculate from calibrated pH, temperature and TAN instead of equating TAN with free ammonia.','pH:7.5→8.0','50/(1+10**(9.25-8.0))')
m('monod','S=10 mg/L；Ks=5 mg/L；μmax=0.1 d⁻¹~S=10 mg/L; Ks=5 mg/L; μmax=0.1 d⁻¹','μ=μmax S/(Ks+S)','0.1*10/(5+10)','d⁻¹','假設單一限制基質且無抑制；不能用此式證明高濃度永遠有利。~Assumes one limiting substrate and no inhibition; it cannot show that high concentration is always beneficial.','以批次比活性測試檢查是否真的符合飽和曲線。~Check the saturation curve with batch specific-activity tests.','S:10→20 mg/L','0.1*20/(5+20)')
m('nbalance','進流 NH4-N=100、NO2-N=132；出流 NO3-N=26 kg N/d~Influent NH4-N=100, NO2-N=132; effluent NO3-N=26 kg N/d','Nother=Nin-Nout','100+132-26','kg N/d','未測項包括 N2、菌體與誤差；不能只憑差值宣稱都是氮氣。~Unmeasured terms include N2, biomass and error; the residual is not proof that all nitrogen became gas.','另外量菌體固體與各溶解氮，列出收支殘差。~Measure biomass and dissolved nitrogen separately and report the balance residual.','NO3-N:26→32 kg N/d','100+132-32')
m('nito2','硝化 NH4-N=40 kg/d；理論 O2/N=4.57~Nitrified NH4-N=40 kg/d; theoretical O2/N=4.57','O2=4.57×N','4.57*40','kg O2/d','完全氧化至硝酸鹽的理論需氧；異營與內源耗氧另外列。~Theoretical complete nitrification demand; heterotrophic and endogenous oxygen demand are separate.','把氨氮轉化量與耗氧率作質量配對。~Pair ammonium conversion with oxygen-uptake measurements.','N:40→50 kg/d','4.57*50')
m('alk','硝化 NH4-N=40 kg/d；鹼度耗量=7.14 kg CaCO3/kg N~Nitrified NH4-N=40 kg/d; alkalinity demand=7.14 kg CaCO3/kg N','A=7.14×N','7.14*40','kg CaCO3/d','化學計量概估，緩衝、進流水鹼度與其他反應仍須納入。~Stoichiometric estimate; buffering, influent alkalinity and other reactions remain necessary.','以滴定鹼度與氮物種變化交叉檢核。~Cross-check titrated alkalinity against changing nitrogen species.','N:40→45 kg/d','7.14*45')
m('alkrec','反硝化 NO3-N=30 kg/d；回復=3.57 kg CaCO3/kg N~Denitrified NO3-N=30 kg/d; recovery=3.57 kg CaCO3/kg N','Arec=3.57×N','3.57*30','kg CaCO3/d','只作反硝化鹼度回收的理論收支，不代表所有硝化耗量均回收。~Theoretical denitrification recovery, not a claim that all nitrification demand is recovered.','在相同採樣日把硝化耗量、反硝化回復與實測鹼度並列。~Tabulate nitrification demand, denitrification recovery and measured alkalinity for the same day.','N:30→35 kg/d','3.57*35')
m('recycle','回流 Qr=6000 m³/d；進流 Q=3000 m³/d~Recycle Qr=6000 m³/d; influent Q=3000 m³/d','R=Qr/Q','6000/3000','ratio','回流提高物質交換也帶回溶氧；比值不是脫氮率。~Recycle improves exchange but also carries oxygen; the ratio is not nitrogen-removal efficiency.','量回流支線流量、DO 與 NO3-N，避免只讀泵轉速。~Measure recycle flow, DO and nitrate instead of using pump speed alone.','Qr:6000→7500 m³/d','7500/3000')
m('calib','參考濃度 x1=0、x2=8 mg/L；儀器讀值 y1=0.2、y2=7.8~Reference x1=0, x2=8 mg/L; readings y1=0.2, y2=7.8','slope=(y2-y1)/(x2-x1)','(7.8-.2)/8','ratio','二點線性校正不能驗證全量程非線性；另留獨立檢查點。~Two-point calibration does not validate full-range nonlinearity; reserve an independent check point.','用第三個參考點比較校正殘差與容許誤差。~Compare a third reference point with calibration residual and required tolerance.','y2:7.8→8.2 mg/L','(8.2-.2)/8')
m('mix','Q1=1000、Q2=500 m³/d；C1=20、C2=80 mg/L~Q1=1000, Q2=500 m³/d; C1=20, C2=80 mg/L','Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)','(1000*20+500*80)/(1000+500)','mg/L','無反應、同一成分與相同濃度基準；不可直接套用 pH。~No reaction and the same species/concentration basis; do not directly average pH this way.','量兩股流量與成分，再在混合充分的位置採樣。~Measure both flows and concentrations, then sample after adequate mixing.','Q2:500→750 m³/d','(1000*20+750*80)/(1000+750)')
m('theta','r20=0.08 d⁻¹；θ=1.07；T=15 °C~r20=0.08 d⁻¹; θ=1.07; T=15 °C','rT=r20 θ^(T-20)','0.08*1.07**(15-20)','d⁻¹','假設係數且限狹窄溫度區間，不能跨菌群或熱失活區外插。~Assumed coefficient in a narrow temperature range; do not extrapolate across populations or thermal inactivation.','由不同溫度的批次資料擬合後，以未參與擬合的資料檢驗。~Fit batch data across temperatures and validate on held-out observations.','T:15→18 °C','0.08*1.07**(18-20)')
m('codp','可利用 COD=120 kg/d；需移除 P=8 kg/d~Available COD=120 kg/d; P to remove=8 kg/d','C/P=COD/P','120/8','kg COD/kg P','進流水質指標而非通用最低需求；須區分 VFA 與其他 COD。~An influent-quality indicator, not a universal minimum requirement; distinguish VFA from other COD.','將 VFA、可快速降解 COD 與正磷酸鹽一起採樣。~Sample VFA, readily biodegradable COD and orthophosphate together.','COD:120→80 kg/d','80/8')
