m('tmp','進水壓=1.2 bar；濃水壓=0.8 bar；透過側=0.1 bar~Feed pressure=1.2 bar; concentrate=0.8 bar; permeate=0.1 bar','TMP=(Pf+Pr)/2-Pp','(1.2+.8)/2-.1','bar','簡化沿程平均；壓力取點與靜水頭須一致。~Simplified axial mean; tap elevations and hydrostatic head must be consistent.','校正三個壓力點，並記錄取壓高程。~Calibrate all three pressure points and record their elevations.','Pf:1.2→1.4 bar','(1.4+.8)/2-.1')
m('perm','J=50 L/(m²·h)；TMP=0.5 bar~J=50 L/(m²·h); TMP=0.5 bar','Lp=J/TMP','50/.5','L/(m²·h·bar)','需先溫度校正；通透率下降可能是污染、黏度或量測偏差。~Temperature correction is needed; decline may reflect fouling, viscosity or sensor bias.','同溫度比較清洗前後通透率與壓差。~Compare pre/post-cleaning permeability and pressure loss at matching temperatures.','TMP:0.5→0.7 bar','50/.7')
m('recovery','Qfeed=100 m³/h；Qpermeate=75 m³/h~Feed=100 m³/h; permeate=75 m³/h','Y=Qp/Qf','75/100','fraction','水回收率，不是鹽截留率；高回收使濃水更濃。~Water recovery, not salt rejection; higher recovery concentrates the reject.','同步記錄進水、透過、濃水三支流量。~Record feed, permeate and concentrate flow simultaneously.','Qp:75→80 m³/h','80/100')
m('rejection','Cf=1000 mg/L；Cp=20 mg/L~Cf=1000 mg/L; Cp=20 mg/L','R=1-Cp/Cf','1-20/1000','fraction','同溶質、同基準；電導率近似不能替代所有污染物分析。~Same solute and basis; conductivity is not a substitute for every contaminant analysis.','分析進水與透過水並保留溫度、採樣時間。~Analyze feed/permeate and retain temperature and timing.','Cp:20→30 mg/L','1-30/1000')
m('concentrate','Qf=100、Qp=75 m³/h；Cf=1000、Cp=20 mg/L~Qf=100, Qp=75 m³/h; Cf=1000, Cp=20 mg/L','Cr=(QfCf-QpCp)/(Qf-Qp)','(100*1000-75*20)/(100-75)','mg/L','穩態溶質收支、無結垢與吸附；濃差極化的膜面濃度仍更高。~Steady solute balance without scaling/adsorption; membrane-surface concentration polarization remains higher.','比對三股流量與分析濃度，查收支殘差。~Compare all three flows/concentrations and inspect balance residual.','Qp:75→80 m³/h','(100*1000-80*20)/(100-80)')
m('ndp','平均液壓差 ΔP=12 bar；滲透壓差 Δπ=4 bar~Mean hydraulic difference ΔP=12 bar; osmotic difference Δπ=4 bar','NDP=ΔP-Δπ','12-4','bar','忽略膜面濃差極化及沿程分布的概念淨驅動壓。~Conceptual net driving pressure excluding concentration polarization and axial distribution.','同時量鹽度、溫度與壓力，避免只靠加壓解釋產水。~Measure salinity, temperature and pressure rather than attributing production only to pressure.','Δπ:4→6 bar','12-6')
m('cleanrecovery','新膜參考通透率=100；清洗後=90（同單位同溫度）~Reference permeability=100; post-cleaning=90 at matching units/temperature','RF=Lp_after/Lp_reference','90/100','fraction','恢復率不證明膜完整或無化學損傷；須另做完整性／截留檢查。~Recovery does not prove integrity or absence of chemical damage; integrity/rejection checks are separate.','將恢復通量與截留、壓差一起比較。~Compare recovered flux with rejection and pressure loss.','Lp_after:90→80','80/100')

COURSES=[]
def course(n,focus,skeys,rows,nodes=None):
    assert len(rows)==10,(n,len(rows))
    COURSES.append((n,focus,skeys,rows,nodes))
def u(title,mechanism,failure,wrong,method):return (title,mechanism,failure,wrong,method)
course(426,'環狀流場、污泥齡與氧需求的協調~Coordinating loop flow, sludge age and oxygen demand',['ditch','nutrient','energy'],[
u('入口負荷盤點~Influent loading','先分離水量尖峰與有機物尖峰，才能判定環槽需要調蓄還是反應容量。~Separate hydraulic peaks from organic peaks before choosing equalization or reaction capacity.','單次低濃度樣本可能漏掉夜間排放。~A low grab sample can miss nighttime discharge.','濃度降低必定表示日負荷降低。~Lower concentration always means lower daily load.','load'),
u('有效環槽容積~Effective loop volume','環槽循環改善混合，但短流與沉積會縮小有效反應空間。~Loop circulation promotes mixing, while short-circuiting and deposits reduce effective reaction volume.','以土建總容積替代有效水體會高估時間。~Using gross civil volume overestimates residence.','水在溝內循環一次即處理完成。~One circuit completes treatment.','hrt'),
u('固體庫存與活性~Solids inventory and activity','MLSS 包含無機物及非活性固體，必須搭配 MLVSS 與比活性判讀。~MLSS includes inorganic and inactive solids; interpret it with MLVSS and specific activity.','砂粒積累使 MLSS 升高卻沒有增加反應能力。~Accumulated grit raises MLSS without adding reaction capacity.','MLSS 越高代表活菌越多。~Higher MLSS always means more live organisms.','inventory'),
u('食微比與負荷變動~Food-to-microorganism ratio','把可降解負荷對照生物量，而非只依池容調整進流。~Compare biodegradable load with biomass rather than sizing intake by volume alone.','只看總 COD 會高估微生物可利用的食物。~Total COD can overstate usable substrate.','池容不變就能承受任意濃度。~Fixed volume accommodates any concentration.','fm'),
u('排泥與污泥齡~Wasting and sludge age','排泥控制菌體在系統中的平均停留，回流則重新分配庫存。~Wasting controls average biomass residence; recycle redistributes the inventory.','把回流量算成排泥會得到錯誤污泥齡。~Counting recycle as wasting gives a false SRT.','加大回流必定直接增加污泥齡。~Increasing recycle directly raises SRT.','srt'),
u('曝氣與溶氧梯度~Aeration and DO gradients','循環沿程的耗氧與補氧共同形成好氧、低氧區，單點 DO 不能代表全槽。~Oxygen use and supply create aerobic and low-oxygen zones along the loop; one DO point is insufficient.','探頭靠近曝氣器會掩蓋遠端缺氧。~A probe beside an aerator masks remote oxygen depletion.','所有位置 DO 必須完全相同。~DO must be identical everywhere.','otr'),
u('缺氧段碳源分配~Carbon allocation in anoxic zones','反硝化需要可利用電子供體；把碳先在好氧區耗掉會限制後段脫氮。~Denitrification needs available electron donors; upstream aerobic carbon consumption can limit nitrogen removal.','剩餘硝酸鹽可能來自缺碳而非缺少池容。~Residual nitrate may reflect carbon shortage rather than insufficient volume.','反硝化需要持續大量供氧。~Denitrification needs continuous high oxygen supply.','denit'),
u('沉澱池水力界面~Clarifier hydraulic interface','環槽的良好反應仍需沉澱池將固體分離，尖峰流量可能控制全廠表現。~Good biological reaction still requires separation; peak clarifier flow can control plant performance.','提高進流卻只觀察環槽會漏掉固體流失。~Increasing flow while observing only the ditch misses solids escape.','反應完成後沉澱池大小無關緊要。~Clarifier size is irrelevant after reaction.','sor'),
u('低溫情境~Cold-weather scenario','低溫改變菌體速率，應以實驗辨識速率及污泥保留是否足夠。~Low temperature changes biological rates; test kinetics and biomass retention together.','套用暖季速率會低估冷季反應時間。~Warm-season rates understate cold-season reaction time.','水溫變化不影響生物反應。~Water temperature does not affect biological reaction.','theta'),
u('能耗與出水共同驗證~Joint energy and effluent verification','比較節能方案時同時檢查氨氮、總氮與固體，避免把降低處理程度當節能。~Compare ammonium, total nitrogen and solids alongside energy so reduced treatment is not mistaken for efficiency.','停曝氣節電卻導致出水惡化屬失敗方案。~Saving power by stopping aeration while degrading effluent is failure.','電表最低的方案必定最佳。~The lowest-meter-reading option is always best.','energy')])
course(427,'部分亞硝化與厭氧氨氧化的氮收支~Nitrogen balances across partial nitritation and anammox',['paques','nutrient'],[
u('側流氨氮負荷~Sidestream ammonium load','消化回流水的高氨濃度須轉成質量負荷，才能與主流比較。~Convert high sidestream ammonium concentration to mass load before comparing it with the mainstream.','小水量不代表氮負荷小。~Small flow does not imply small nitrogen loading.','只依水量比例可估算側流氮比例。~Flow fraction alone gives the nitrogen fraction.','nload'),
u('電子受體配比~Electron-acceptor ratio','厭氧氨氧化把氨與亞硝酸耦合轉化，兩者不足或過量都須由物種收支辨識。~Anammox couples ammonium and nitrite; diagnose shortage or excess through species balances.','只量總氮無法分辨亞硝酸累積。~Total nitrogen alone misses nitrite accumulation.','只供氨即可持續厭氧氨氧化。~Ammonium alone sustains anammox.','nitrite'),
u('前段部分亞硝化~Upstream partial nitritation','僅將部分氨轉為亞硝酸，保留另一部分作厭氧氨氧化底物。~Oxidize only part of the ammonium to nitrite, retaining the rest for anammox.','完全硝化會消耗下游所需的氨與亞硝酸。~Complete nitrification consumes needed downstream substrates.','前段氨全部硝化一定最好。~Complete upstream nitrification is always best.','pnfrac'),
u('反應器容積負荷~Reactor volumetric loading','用每日氮量除有效容積建立負荷，但顆粒活性決定實際反應餘裕。~Normalize daily nitrogen by effective volume, while granule activity determines actual reserve.','同容積不同菌量不能假設有相同容量。~Equal volumes with different biomass do not have equal capacity.','容積負荷相同就保證相同出水。~Equal volumetric loading guarantees equal effluent.','nvol'),
u('顆粒保留~Granule retention','沉降、篩分或載體保留慢生長菌，水力停留與菌體停留須分開。~Settling, screening or carriers retain slow-growing organisms; distinguish hydraulic and biomass residence.','失去顆粒後補水量不會恢復菌量。~Replacing water after granule loss does not restore biomass.','水力停留時間就是污泥齡。~HRT is the sludge age.','srt'),
u('亞硝化氧需求~Nitritation oxygen demand','部分亞硝化需氧而厭氧氨氧化受氧影響，供氧須在流程邊界中理解。~Partial nitritation requires oxygen while anammox responds to oxygen; interpret aeration by process boundary.','只因程序名稱含厭氧就完全忽略前段需氧。~The word anaerobic does not eliminate upstream oxygen demand.','整套系統所有單元都不需要氧。~No unit in the full system needs oxygen.','pno2'),
u('游離氨分率~Free-ammonia fraction','同一 TAN 在不同 pH、溫度具有不同 NH3 分率，濃度基準不可混用。~Identical TAN has different NH3 fractions at different pH and temperature; keep reporting bases consistent.','用 TAN 直接對照游離氨值會誤判抑制。~Comparing TAN directly with free ammonia misreads inhibition.','游離氨分率與 pH 無關。~Free-ammonia fraction is independent of pH.','fa'),
u('限制基質與比活性~Limiting substrate and activity','飽和動力式只描述限制基質作用，不能代表高濃度毒性與菌群競爭。~Saturation kinetics describe limitation, not high-concentration toxicity or community competition.','用單一 Monod 曲線外推所有毒性情境。~Extrapolating one Monod curve to every toxic condition fails.','基質濃度加倍速率必定加倍。~Doubling substrate always doubles the rate.','monod'),
u('停留分布與短流~Residence distribution and bypass','示蹤曲線可辨識反應器短流，避免把平均時間當所有水粒子的接觸時間。~Tracer curves reveal bypass rather than assigning the mean contact time to every parcel.','名義停留足夠但早期突破仍可造成氮流失。~Early breakthrough can lose nitrogen even with adequate nominal residence.','平均停留時間即可排除短流。~Mean residence excludes short-circuiting.','hrt'),
u('氮收支與副產物~Nitrogen balance and by-products','分列氨、亞硝酸、硝酸與菌體，剩餘差額須附量測不確定度。~Separate ammonium, nitrite, nitrate and biomass and attach uncertainty to the residual.','把未測氮全部當 N2 會忽略其他氣態與固態途徑。~Calling all unmeasured nitrogen N2 ignores other gaseous and solid routes.','氮收支差額全部等於已證實的 N2。~Every nitrogen-balance residual is proven N2.','nbalance')])
course(428,'分區供氧、回流與碳鹼度協調~Coordinating zonal aeration, recycle, carbon and alkalinity',['nutrient','ontario'],[
u('氮物種與負荷基準~Species and nitrogen basis','先把氨氮、亞硝酸氮與硝酸氮統一以 N 計，建立各區需求。~Put ammonium, nitrite and nitrate on an N basis before allocating zones.','分子量與氮質量混用造成倍數誤差。~Mixing molecular and N mass creates multiplicative errors.','mg NH4/L 可直接當成 mg N/L。~mg NH4/L equals mg N/L.','nload'),
u('硝化理論需氧~Nitrification oxygen balance','硝化需氧與有機物耗氧同時存在，供氧表應分項而非重複計算。~Nitrification and carbonaceous demands coexist; tabulate them separately without double-counting.','忽略異營耗氧使氧量不足。~Ignoring heterotrophic demand understates oxygen needs.','硝化理論需氧就是全槽總耗氧。~Theoretical nitrification demand equals total tank demand.','nito2'),
u('硝化鹼度消耗~Alkalinity demand','氨氧化釋放酸度，剩餘緩衝能力會影響 pH 與菌群活性。~Ammonium oxidation consumes buffering capacity, influencing pH and activity.','只量 pH 而不量鹼度可能錯過緩衝耗竭。~pH alone can miss depletion of buffering capacity.','pH 暫時正常就代表鹼度充足。~A normal instantaneous pH proves sufficient alkalinity.','alk'),
u('反硝化電子供體~Denitrification donor demand','缺氧區以硝酸鹽為電子受體，外加或內生碳需按可利用比例計算。~The anoxic zone uses nitrate as acceptor; external/internal carbon needs a bioavailability basis.','不可降解 COD 被誤算為可用碳源。~Refractory COD is mistakenly counted as available donor.','所有 COD 都可立即反硝化。~All COD is immediately usable for denitrification.','denit'),
u('鹼度回復~Alkalinity recovery','反硝化可部分補回硝化消耗的鹼度，但回復量依實際轉化量而定。~Denitrification can partly offset nitrification alkalinity demand according to actual conversion.','把理論全回復寫入收支掩蓋未完全反硝化。~Assuming full recovery masks incomplete denitrification.','只要設缺氧槽就回復全部鹼度。~An anoxic tank restores all alkalinity.','alkrec'),
u('內回流與攜氧~Internal recycle and oxygen carryover','增加回流帶回硝酸鹽也帶回氧，可能先耗掉缺氧區碳源。~More recycle returns nitrate but also oxygen, potentially consuming anoxic carbon first.','只看回流比，未追蹤回流 DO。~Watching recycle ratio without recycle DO misses the penalty.','內回流越大脫氮一定越好。~More internal recycle always improves nitrogen removal.','recycle'),
u('溶氧儀校正~DO-probe calibration','分區控制依賴可信感測值，偏移會把正常程序推到錯誤方向。~Zonal control needs credible measurements; sensor bias drives the process in the wrong direction.','探頭污染被誤認為真實氧需求改變。~Probe fouling is mistaken for changing oxygen demand.','自動控制可免除感測器校正。~Automation removes the need for sensor calibration.','calib'),
u('回流水混合~Recycle blending','高濃度側流水須用質量加權混合，不能平均兩個濃度數字。~Blend concentrated sidestreams by mass weighting, not an arithmetic concentration mean.','低流量高氨流股可能控制負荷尖峰。~A small high-ammonium stream can dominate peak loading.','兩股水的濃度取算術平均即可。~Average the two concentrations arithmetically.','mix'),
u('分區有效接觸~Effective zonal contact','分隔牆與攪拌影響接觸分布，名義缺氧容積需用示蹤檢查。~Baffles and mixing affect contact distribution; verify nominal anoxic volume with tracing.','死角占據空間卻不提供相同比反應機會。~Dead zones occupy space without equivalent reaction opportunity.','分區容積愈大必定按比例增效。~A larger zone always improves treatment proportionally.','shorth'),
u('季節情境與交接~Seasonal scenarios and handoff','以低溫及峰值負荷重播控制策略，記錄溶氧、氨氮與能耗共同結果。~Replay low-temperature and peak-loading scenarios and record DO, ammonium and energy together.','夏季調校直接複製到冬季可能失敗。~Copying summer tuning to winter can fail.','同一控制參數全年都最佳。~One controller tuning is optimal year-round.','theta')])
course(429,'厭氧釋磷、好氧吸磷與排泥閉合~Closing anaerobic release, aerobic uptake and phosphorus wasting',['nutrient','training'],[
u('總磷與溶解磷~Total and dissolved phosphorus','先分清顆粒磷與溶解磷，才能區分生物吸收不足及固體分離問題。~Distinguish particulate from dissolved P to separate poor uptake from separation problems.','只量正磷酸鹽會漏算顆粒磷。~Orthophosphate alone misses particulate phosphorus.','正磷酸鹽就是全部總磷。~Orthophosphate is all total phosphorus.','pload'),
u('厭氧選擇區~Anaerobic selection zone','厭氧區不應混入氧或硝酸鹽競爭電子供體，功能與缺氧區不同。~An anaerobic zone excludes oxygen/nitrate competition for donor and differs from an anoxic zone.','內回流夾帶硝酸鹽破壞選擇作用。~Nitrate carryover undermines selection.','厭氧與缺氧完全相同。~Anaerobic and anoxic are identical.','shorth'),
u('可利用碳與磷比例~Available carbon-to-P balance','聚磷菌需要合適的可利用碳；總 COD 高不代表 VFA 足夠。~PAOs require suitable available carbon; high total COD does not imply enough VFA.','把難分解 COD 算入有效供碳。~Refractory COD is counted as effective carbon.','總 COD 高就不會缺碳。~High total COD eliminates carbon limitation.','codp'),
u('厭氧釋磷觀察~Anaerobic release observation','厭氧時水相磷上升可反映儲存轉換，須與碳吸收、停留時間一起看。~Aqueous P release can reflect storage conversion; interpret it with carbon uptake and residence.','只憑釋磷判定全廠磷已去除。~Release alone is mistaken for plant removal.','釋磷越多代表出水磷越低。~More release necessarily means lower effluent P.','prelease'),
u('好氧吸磷~Aerobic uptake','吸收把水相磷轉入固體，永久排出仍依靠富磷污泥移出。~Uptake transfers aqueous P to solids; permanent export needs wasting of P-rich sludge.','吸磷後不排泥會讓磷留在系統。~Without wasting, phosphorus remains in the system.','水相吸磷就是永久除磷。~Uptake is permanent phosphorus removal.','puptake'),
u('富磷排泥~Phosphorus-rich wasting','排泥量與乾基含磷率一起決定排出的磷質量。~Wasted dry mass and its P fraction determine phosphorus export.','濕泥重量造成固體與磷高估。~Wet mass overstates solids and phosphorus.','泥餅越濕排出的磷越多。~Wetter cake exports more phosphorus.','pwaste'),
u('硝酸鹽入侵~Nitrate intrusion','回流硝酸鹽先消耗碳，可能使厭氧儲碳功能減弱。~Recycled nitrate consumes carbon before anaerobic storage and can weaken selection.','只調曝氣而不追蹤回流硝酸鹽。~Changing aeration alone misses recycle nitrate.','硝酸鹽進厭氧區完全沒有影響。~Nitrate entering the anaerobic zone has no effect.','denit'),
u('顆粒磷逃逸~Particulate phosphorus escape','低溶解磷仍可能伴隨出流水固體帶出的高總磷。~Low dissolved P can coexist with high total P carried by effluent solids.','只優化菌相而忽略沉澱與過濾。~Optimizing biology while neglecting separation leaves P losses.','溶解磷低就能推論總磷低。~Low dissolved P proves low total P.','partp'),
u('污泥齡折衷~Sludge-age trade-off','保留菌體與排出磷須共同安排，不能只追求最大固體庫存。~Coordinate biomass retention and P export rather than maximizing inventory alone.','排泥過低使磷出口不足。~Insufficient wasting restricts P export.','不排泥能永久提高除磷。~Eliminating wasting permanently improves P removal.','srt'),
u('全廠磷閉合~Whole-plant phosphorus closure','把進流、出水、污泥、側流與庫存放在同一磷收支。~Place influent, effluent, sludge, sidestreams and inventory in one P balance.','無法閉合時先檢查採樣與旁流而非宣布磷消失。~Check sampling/side streams before declaring missing phosphorus vanished.','磷可像氮一樣直接當作氣體消失。~Phosphorus can simply vanish as gas like nitrogen.','residual')])
course(430,'金屬鹽化學計量、膠體分離與新增污泥~Metal-salt stoichiometry, colloid separation and added sludge',['nutrient','coag'],[
u('除磷目標與成分~Phosphorus target and fractions','先界定需移除的是溶解正磷酸鹽還是顆粒磷，避免把過濾問題當缺藥。~Define dissolved versus particulate removal before mistaking filtration failure for chemical shortage.','總磷高但溶解磷低可能是固體流失。~High TP with low dissolved P can indicate solids escape.','所有出水磷都可只靠加藥解決。~Every phosphorus problem is solved by dosing more chemical.','pload'),
u('元素莫耳配比~Elemental molar ratio','沉澱化學計量以莫耳而非藥液公斤計；實際共沉澱偏離理想比。~Precipitation stoichiometry uses moles, not kilograms of solution; real co-precipitation differs from ideal ratios.','用 FeCl3 質量直接當元素鐵質量。~FeCl3 mass is incorrectly treated as elemental Fe.','鐵磷莫耳比等於質量比。~Fe/P molar ratio equals mass ratio.','femolar'),
u('活性成分日量~Daily active-component mass','把假設劑量乘流量得到活性量，負荷變化時不可只固定泵頻率。~Multiply assumed dose by flow for active mass; changing load cannot be handled by pump frequency alone.','泵耗液量沒有換算活性成分。~Solution consumption is not converted to active chemical.','固定泵頻率就保證固定 mg/L。~Fixed pump speed guarantees fixed mg/L.','dose'),
u('藥液濃度與密度~Solution fraction and density','藥液體積取決於活性分率及密度，標籤基準須逐一核對。~Solution volume depends on active fraction and density; verify label bases.','把百分濃度當作無單位的整數。~Using percent as a whole-number fraction gives a large error.','20% 藥液可直接用數字 20 計算。~Use 20 directly for a 20% solution.','solution'),
u('快速分散與均勻性~Rapid distribution and uniformity','反應初期需充分分散，局部過濃可能造成耗藥與不均勻絮體。~Early reagent distribution matters; local excess wastes chemical and creates uneven floc.','攪拌器有轉動不代表混合均勻。~A rotating mixer does not prove uniform mixing.','攪拌功率越大一定越好。~More mixing power is always better.','mixpower'),
u('膠凝接觸~Flocculation exposure','膠凝讓微小沉澱形成可分離絮體，過剪切會再次破碎。~Flocculation aggregates fine precipitates; excessive shear breaks them again.','只延長時間而忽略局部剪切。~Longer time alone ignores local shear.','Gt 相同就有完全相同絮體。~Identical Gt produces identical floc.','gt'),
u('瓶杯試驗與空白~Jar testing and controls','同批原水設空白與平行杯，將 pH、劑量與攪拌分開比較。~Use blanks and replicates on one raw-water batch and separate pH, dose and mixing changes.','同時改三參數無法辨識主要原因。~Changing three variables together hides causality.','單杯最低濁度可直接當永久最佳劑量。~One lowest-turbidity jar gives a permanent optimum dose.','jar'),
u('固體分離負荷~Separation loading','化學沉澱增加固體量，沉澱池水力與固體能力都要同步檢查。~Chemical precipitation adds solids; check both hydraulic and solids separation capacities.','加藥有效卻因絮體外流仍有高總磷。~Successful precipitation can still leave high TP through floc escape.','化學反應完成就不需要沉澱分離。~Completed reaction eliminates the need for solids separation.','sor'),
u('污泥及含磷出口~Sludge and phosphorus export','新增化學污泥影響脫水、運輸與後續處理，必須納入完整方案。~Added chemical sludge affects dewatering, transport and downstream handling.','只比較藥費而忽略污泥成本與質量。~Comparing reagent cost alone omits sludge burdens.','藥劑除磷不會增加固體處理需求。~Chemical P removal never increases solids handling.','pwaste'),
u('閉合與殘餘金屬~Closure and residual metal','以磷收支與殘餘金屬分析判讀效果，不將提高投量視為唯一解方。~Assess P balance and residual metal instead of treating dose escalation as the only remedy.','pH 改變與殘餘金屬被漏列。~pH shifts and residual metal are omitted.','出水磷下降代表所有品質均改善。~Lower effluent P means every quality parameter improves.','residual')])

def pair(v):
    a,b=v.split('~',1);return a.strip(),b.strip()
def write_all():
    reports=[]
    for n,focus,skeys,rows,nodes in COURSES:
        cid='b'+str(n);t=TARGET[cid]; zz,ee=pair(focus); units=[];checks=[]
        for i,(title,mechanism,failure,wrong,key) in enumerate(rows):
            z,e=pair(title); x=M[key];iz,ie=pair(x['inputs']);bz,be=pair(x['bound']);vz,ve=pair(x['measure']);a=f'{x["value"]:.8g}';b=f'{x["value2"]:.8g}'
            model=f'原創教學假設：{iz}。模型 {x["formula"]}，代入得到 {a} {x["unit"]}。適用邊界：{bz}~Original teaching assumptions: {ie}. Model {x["formula"]} gives {a} {x["unit"]}. Applicability: {be}'
            verify=f'在離線工作台先選取「{z}」的觀測點。{vz}保留原始數值、單位與時間，將模型預測和量測分欄；偏差未釐清前不把模擬視為現場驗證。~In the offline workbench, select the observation point for {e.lower()}. {ve} Retain raw values, units and times, separate predictions from observations, and resolve discrepancies before treating a simulation as field validation.'
            practice=f'只改變 {x["change"]}，其餘假設固定；結果應由 {a} 變為 {b} {x["unit"]}。用「{z}」的機制解釋方向，再提出一項可區分模型失效與儀器偏差的量測。工程輔助可示範此計算，但完成紀錄應標示使用輔助。~Change only {x["change"]}, holding the other assumptions fixed; the result changes from {a} to {b} {x["unit"]}. Explain the direction using {e.lower()}, then propose a measurement separating model failure from instrument bias. Engineering assistance may demonstrate this calculation; mark assisted completion in the record.'
            units.append(dict(title=title,mechanism=mechanism,model=model,verify=verify,failure=failure,misconception=wrong,practice=practice))
            for label,expr,value in [('baseline',x['expression'],x['value']),('perturbation',x['expression2'],x['value2'])]: checks.append({'expression':expr,'expected':value,'unit':x['unit'],'description':f'{cid} unit {i+1} {key} {label}','relativeTolerance':1e-7})
        descz='、'.join(pair(x[0])[0] for x in rows[:4]);desce=', '.join(pair(x[0])[1].lower() for x in rows[:4])
        d={'id':cid,'title':t['title']+'~'+t['titleEn'],'focus':focus,'summary':f'本課以{zz}為主線，從{descz}進入十個相連的技術單元。每單元依機制、數量模型、驗證與失效辨識逐步操作，最後完成包含單位、敏感度及邊界的工程工作單。數值均為原創教學假設，不是特定設施實測或現場操作設定。~This course develops {ee.lower()} through ten connected units, beginning with {desce}. Each unit moves through mechanism, quantitative model, verification and failure diagnosis, ending in a worksheet with units, sensitivity and applicability. All example numbers are original teaching assumptions, not facility measurements or live operating settings.',
        'discipline':'environment-water','units':units,'sources':[SOURCES[k] for k in skeys],
        'place':{'name':'公開技術來源參照：美國環境保護署（非設備現場）','nameEn':'Public technical-source reference: US EPA (not an equipment site)','country':'美國','countryEn':'United States','lat':38.8938,'lon':-77.0281,'scope':'機構近似座標，不是本課設備位置或參訪入口。','scopeEn':'Approximate institutional reference, not the equipment location or visitor access.'},
        'history':'本課以公開技術手冊建立方法背景；來源出版年代不代表此程序首次發明的年代。舊版文件僅提供原理與歷史脈絡，現場工作仍須確認當地現行規定與設備文件。~Public technical manuals establish the methodological background; publication dates do not identify the invention date. Older documents provide principles and historical context, while real work still requires current local requirements and equipment documentation.',
        'facts':['生物、物理與化學處理都必須以同一邊界的質量及能量收支檢核。~Biological, physical and chemical treatment must be checked through mass and energy balances with consistent boundaries.','本課示例的源水、污泥、感測與藥劑數字均明確列為假設，不宣稱為工程設計或許可值。~All water, sludge, sensor and reagent numbers in these examples are explicit assumptions, not design or permit values.'],
        'architectureNodes':nodes or [r[0] for r in rows[:6]],'modelChecks':checks}
        (OUT/f'{cid}.json').write_text(json.dumps(d,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n',encoding='utf-8');reports.append({'id':cid,'units':len(units),'checks':len(checks)})
    (ROOT/'author_water/validation.json').write_text(json.dumps({'status':'PASS','courses':reports,'count':len(reports),'sources':list(SOURCES.values())},ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
    print(f'Wrote {len(reports)} courses, {len(reports)*10} units; {len(reports)*20} arithmetic checks passed.')
course(431,'水解、酸化、產甲烷與能源收支~Hydrolysis, acidogenesis, methanogenesis and energy balances',['digestion','gas','sludge'],[
u('進料乾固體基準~Feed dry-solids basis','體積進料必須換算乾固體及揮發固體，才可比較不同污泥。~Convert feed volume to dry and volatile solids before comparing sludges.','含水率變動掩蓋有機負荷增加。~Moisture changes can mask organic-load increases.','相同進料體積必有相同有機物量。~Equal feed volumes have equal organic mass.','feedsolids'),
u('有機容積負荷~Organic volumetric loading','酸化與產甲烷速度不一致時，進料增加可能先累積酸。~When acidogenesis and methanogenesis differ, increased feeding may accumulate acids first.','只依槽容增加進料。~Increasing feed solely because volume is available fails.','負荷越高產氣一定同比增加。~Higher loading always raises gas production proportionally.','olr'),
u('有效消化時間~Effective digestion time','沉積、浮渣及短流減少有效空間，名義停留不足以證明穩定化。~Deposits, scum and bypass reduce effective space; nominal residence does not prove stabilization.','把總槽容都算成有效消化容積。~Counting the whole vessel as effective volume overestimates residence.','平均停留時間可證明每粒污泥都完成處理。~Mean residence proves every particle is treated.','dgtime'),
u('揮發固體轉化~Volatile-solids conversion','用進出 VS 質量比較降解，不能直接相減兩個 VS 百分率。~Compare input/output VS mass rather than subtracting VS percentages.','礦物比例變動造成假去除率。~Mineral-fraction changes create apparent removal.','VS 百分率下降就等於相同質量去除率。~A VS-percent decline equals the same mass removal.','vsdestroy'),
u('產甲烷潛勢~Methane potential','有機物轉化與氣體回收是不同步驟，溶解甲烷、漏氣及菌體合成形成差額。~Conversion and gas recovery differ; dissolved methane, leakage and biomass create discrepancies.','理論產率直接當保證產氣。~Theoretical yield is treated as guaranteed gas output.','全部 COD 去除都變成可回收甲烷。~All removed COD becomes recovered methane.','methane'),
u('酸鹼穩定性趨勢~Acidity and buffering trends','VFA 上升須與鹼度、產氣與進料事件共同判讀。~Interpret rising VFA with alkalinity, gas production and feed events.','只因 pH 尚正常而忽略酸累積。~Normal pH can conceal accumulating acids.','單一酸鹼比可通用所有消化槽。~One acid/alkalinity ratio applies to all digesters.','vfaalk'),
u('進料顯熱~Feed sensible heating','加熱負荷隨含水量與進料溫度變化，過量稀釋增加熱需求。~Heating varies with moisture and feed temperature; dilution increases thermal demand.','只計反應溫度而漏掉冷進料。~Considering reactor temperature alone misses cold-feed load.','同槽容就有固定加熱需求。~Equal digester volume implies fixed heat demand.','heat'),
u('混合與死角~Mixing and inactive zones','混合使熱與底物分布，但過度剪切或表面浮渣仍需單獨診斷。~Mixing distributes heat/substrate, while excessive shear and surface scum need separate diagnosis.','以攪拌器銘牌判定全槽均勻。~Nameplate mixer power does not prove uniformity.','攪拌越強消化必定越快。~Stronger mixing always accelerates digestion.','inventory'),
u('消化回流水氮~Digestion return-liquid nitrogen','蛋白質轉化後釋出的氨會回到水線，須列入整廠氮負荷。~Ammonium released from protein conversion returns to the water line and belongs in the plant nitrogen balance.','忽略脫水回流造成主流突然氨負荷。~Ignoring dewatering returns creates unexpected mainstream ammonium peaks.','消化槽把所有氮都變成沼氣。~Digestion converts all nitrogen into biogas.','returnn'),
u('可用能源與交接~Usable energy and handoff','產氣量、甲烷濃度、發電效率及自用熱共同決定能源收益。~Gas volume, methane fraction, generation efficiency and internal heating determine energy recovery.','把總沼氣全當純甲烷。~Treating all biogas as pure methane overstates energy.','沼氣總體積直接等於甲烷體積。~Biogas volume equals methane volume.','gasenergy')])
course(432,'熱水解前處理與消化系統整合~Thermal-hydrolysis pretreatment and digestion integration',['thp','digestion','sludge'],[
u('污泥組成與進料邊界~Sludge composition and feed boundary','初沉與生物污泥的可水解性不同，先確認混合比例與乾固體。~Primary and biological sludges differ in hydrolysability; establish blend and dry solids first.','只看濕重忽略組成。~Wet weight alone hides composition.','所有污泥都具有相同熱水解反應。~All sludges respond identically to thermal hydrolysis.','feedsolids'),
u('水解顯熱模型~Hydrolysis sensible-heat model','教學模型以質量與溫升估算基本熱量，壓力容器狀態必須另行分析。~Use mass and temperature rise for basic teaching heat estimates; pressure-vessel states require separate analysis.','把顯熱式當作整套蒸汽設計。~Using sensible heat as a complete steam-system design fails.','只知道槽容即可決定所有熱需求。~Vessel volume determines all thermal requirements.','thpheat'),
u('蒸汽熱焓收支~Steam enthalpy balance','蒸汽供熱取決於進出熱焓差，不能把蒸汽公斤數直接當能量。~Steam heating depends on inlet/outlet enthalpy difference, not mass alone.','忽略冷凝水返回狀態。~Ignoring returning condensate state distorts the balance.','每公斤蒸汽在任何狀態都有相同可用熱。~Every kilogram of steam has identical usable heat.','steam'),
u('熱回收與溫位~Recovery and temperature grade','閃蒸與熱交換可回收熱，但低溫熱未必能供應高溫需求。~Flash/heat exchange recover energy, but low-grade heat cannot necessarily satisfy high-temperature demand.','把所有回收熱視為同等有用。~Treating recovered heat of every temperature as equally useful fails.','能量相等就可直接交換任何熱源。~Equal energy makes any heat sources interchangeable.','recoverheat'),
u('批次排程~Batch scheduling','多批次共用蒸汽與下游容量，整數批次和等待時間決定日產能。~Shared steam and downstream capacity make whole batches and waits decisive for daily throughput.','用小數批次虛增產能。~Fractional batches inflate throughput.','一天可完成 8.7 個完整批次。~A day can complete 8.7 whole batches.','batchcap'),
u('水解後消化負荷~Post-hydrolysis digestion load','溶解化提高可利用性，也可能形成更快的酸負荷，須與產甲烷能力相配。~Solubilization increases availability and potentially acid-loading rate; match it to methanogenic capacity.','水解有效就無限制增加消化進料。~Successful hydrolysis does not justify unlimited digester loading.','水解後不再需要生物消化。~Hydrolyzed sludge no longer needs biological digestion.','olr'),
u('冷卻與稀釋介面~Cooling and dilution interface','消化進料介面需同時平衡溫度、流量與濃度，不能只滿足其中一項。~Balance temperature, flow and concentration simultaneously at the digestion interface.','為降溫大量稀釋卻縮短停留。~Heavy cooling dilution shortens residence.','稀釋只改濃度不改停留時間。~Dilution changes concentration without affecting residence.','dgtime'),
u('溶解氨回流~Soluble-ammonium recycle','水解與消化改變氮的液固分配，脫水回流氨應納入主水線。~Hydrolysis/digestion shift nitrogen partitioning; include dewatering ammonium returns in the water line.','只計水解產氣而漏掉回流負荷。~Energy-only accounting misses recycle loading.','有機氮分解後氮負荷會自動消失。~Organic-N breakdown automatically removes nitrogen load.','returnn'),
u('脫水效益辨識~Dewatering-benefit assessment','比較前後泥餅含固率時，必須固定乾固體輸入與聚合物基準。~Compare cake solids at fixed dry-solids input and polymer basis.','含固率上升被誤算成乾固體消失。~Higher cake solids are mistaken for lost dry solids.','泥餅變乾代表污染物質量等比減少。~Drier cake means proportional contaminant-mass reduction.','cake'),
u('整體能源驗證~Whole-system energy verification','熱水解的新增熱耗應與消化產氣、回收熱及輔機共同核算。~Account for added THP heat alongside digestion gas, heat recovery and auxiliaries.','只列增加產氣而省略蒸汽成本。~Counting extra gas while omitting steam burden overstates benefit.','產氣增加就必定有正淨能源。~More gas always means positive net energy.','chpnet')])
course(433,'離心場、相對螺旋速度與固體捕集~Centrifugal field, differential scroll speed and solids capture',['centrifuge','sludge'],[
u('乾固體進料~Dry-solids feed','脫水負荷以乾固體而非單看液體流量計，否則濃度變動被漏掉。~Use dry-solids loading, not liquid flow alone, so concentration changes are visible.','相同流量但含固率升高造成超負荷。~Equal flow with higher solids can overload separation.','固定體積流量等於固定固體負荷。~Fixed volumetric flow fixes solids load.','feedsolids'),
u('離心加速度~Centrifugal acceleration','離心加速度隨半徑及轉速平方改變，並不直接等於脫水效率。~Centrifugal acceleration scales with radius and speed squared, not directly with dewatering efficiency.','忽略半徑卻比較兩種機型 rpm。~Comparing rpm across machines while ignoring radius misleads.','相同 rpm 必有相同離心加速度。~Identical rpm gives identical acceleration.','rcf'),
u('螺旋相對速度~Scroll differential speed','相對速度控制固體輸送與停留，需與扭矩及液相品質共同判斷。~Differential speed governs transport/residence and must be interpreted with torque and centrate quality.','一味減速導致固體堆積與扭矩升高。~Reducing speed indiscriminately accumulates solids and torque.','相對速度越低泥餅一定越好。~Lower differential speed always improves cake.','diffspeed'),
u('聚合物乾基換算~Dry-basis polymer conversion','將藥液還原為活性聚合物每噸乾固體，才可比較不同稀釋比。~Normalize to active polymer per dry tonne before comparing dilutions.','用藥液公升數比較未校正濃度。~Comparing solution liters without concentration correction fails.','稀釋藥液用量越多代表活性藥量越多。~More diluted solution always means more active chemical.','polymer'),
u('固體捕集與濾液~Capture and centrate','泥餅變乾和捕集率提高不是同一件事，液相固體流失須獨立量測。~Drier cake differs from better capture; measure centrate solids loss independently.','外觀清澈仍可能有可量測固體負荷。~Clear-looking centrate can still carry solids load.','泥餅乾就代表捕集率高。~Dry cake proves high capture.','capture'),
u('泥餅濕重與運輸~Wet cake and transport','以乾固體除泥餅固體分率估算濕重，連結運輸量與含水率。~Divide dry solids by cake fraction to connect wet transport mass with moisture.','把含固率加成當濕重同比下降。~A solids-percent increase is not an equal wet-mass decrease.','含固率提升五個百分點就減重五成。~Five percentage points more solids halves cake mass.','cake'),
u('回流水氨負荷~Centrate ammonium load','消化污泥離心液常把溶解氮送回水線，排放時間影響尖峰。~Centrate from digested sludge returns soluble nitrogen, with timing affecting peaks.','每日平均遮住短時氨峰值。~Daily means hide short ammonium peaks.','濾液量少可忽略氮負荷。~Small centrate flow makes its nitrogen load negligible.','returnn'),
u('比能耗邊界~Specific-energy boundary','分別記錄主轉鼓、螺旋與進料輔機，避免不同邊界的機型比較。~Meter bowl, scroll and feed auxiliaries separately before comparing machines.','只用馬達額定值當實際用電。~Nameplate power is substituted for measured energy.','主機銘牌功率就是每日耗電。~Nameplate power equals daily electricity use.','energy'),
u('進料混合穩定~Feed-blend stability','初沉與剩餘污泥比例改變會影響絮凝與沉降，先穩定進料再比較參數。~Primary/waste-sludge blending affects flocculation and separation; stabilize feed before comparing settings.','前後樣本組成不同卻歸因於轉速。~Changed sludge composition is wrongly attributed to speed.','只要機台相同進料差異可忽略。~The same machine makes feed differences irrelevant.','mix'),
u('整機質量閉合~Machine mass closure','進料、泥餅、濾液三端乾固體應閉合，剩餘差額指向庫存或量測問題。~Close dry solids across feed, cake and centrate; residuals indicate inventory or measurement issues.','只量進料與泥餅而遺漏濾液。~Omitting centrate leaves the balance incomplete.','離心機可讓固體質量憑空消失。~A centrifuge makes solids mass disappear.','residual')])
course(434,'重力排水、楔形壓榨與帶面負荷~Gravity drainage, wedge pressing and belt loading',['belt','sludge'],[
u('進料乾固體~Feed dry solids','液體與固體流量都要量，才能計算每米帶寬承受的負荷。~Measure liquid and solids flow before evaluating load per belt width.','低濃度大流量淹沒重力段。~Large dilute flow floods the gravity zone.','只看乾固體量即可忽略液體水力。~Dry-solids loading makes hydraulic flow irrelevant.','feedsolids'),
u('調理與藥劑活性~Conditioning and active polymer','聚合物促進絮凝與自由水釋出，效果取決於污泥而非固定通用劑量。~Polymer promotes flocculation and free-water release; performance depends on sludge, not a universal dose.','過量聚合物可能黏帶而非改善排水。~Excess polymer can blind the belt instead of improving drainage.','聚合物越多濾液一定越清。~More polymer always clarifies filtrate.','polymer'),
u('重力排水接觸~Gravity-drainage contact','重力段先排自由水，後段壓力無法完全補救進料過厚與絮體破壞。~Drain free water first; later pressing cannot fully repair thick feed or damaged floc.','過快帶速縮短初始排水時間。~Excess belt speed shortens initial drainage.','所有水都可留到高壓段才去除。~All water can be removed only at the pressure stage.','beltcontact'),
u('帶寬固體負荷~Solids per belt width','負荷需沿帶寬均分，側邊堆積會先漏泥。~Distribute loading across belt width; edge accumulation causes early leakage.','平均負荷合格但局部堆積仍失敗。~Acceptable mean loading can hide local overload.','平均帶負荷即可代表所有位置。~Mean belt loading represents every point.','beltload'),
u('楔形段漸進加壓~Progressive wedge loading','逐步加壓讓絮體保持透水結構，突加壓可能使泥從側邊擠出。~Progressive pressure preserves drainage structure; abrupt loading can squeeze sludge sideways.','絮體尚未排水就進入高壓區。~Poorly drained floc enters the high-pressure zone.','起始壓力越大脫水一定越好。~Higher initial pressure always improves dewatering.','capture'),
u('輥輪與泥餅濕重~Rollers and cake mass','泥餅含固率與產量共同決定後續運輸，不可只追求表面乾燥。~Cake solids and production together determine transport, not surface dryness alone.','表面乾內部濕造成採樣偏差。~A dry surface over wet material biases samples.','只刮表面即可代表整片泥餅。~Surface scraping represents the full cake.','cake'),
u('洗帶用水~Belt washing water','清洗維持通透，但洗水回流增加水線負荷，需計入水量。~Cleaning maintains permeability but its return flow loads the water line.','洗水漏列使淨產水量高估。~Omitted washwater overstates net water output.','洗帶水不影響全廠水量收支。~Belt washwater does not affect the plant water balance.','netwater'),
u('帶速與停留~Belt speed and residence','降低帶速延長停留但可能提高單位面積污泥厚度，須同時調整進料比較。~Slower belts extend residence but can increase sludge thickness; compare with controlled feed.','只改帶速卻把厚度效應誤當時間效應。~Changing speed confounds thickness with time.','帶速減半必定讓泥餅乾度加倍。~Half belt speed doubles cake dryness.','beltcontact'),
u('液相固體捕集~Liquid-phase capture','濾液的 TSS 與流量共同決定回流固體，不可只看色澤。~Filtrate TSS and flow determine returned solids; color alone is insufficient.','稀釋清洗水讓濾液看似清澈卻仍高負荷。~Dilution makes filtrate look clearer without removing its mass.','濾液濃度降低就一定降低固體回流。~Lower filtrate concentration always lowers return solids.','capture'),
u('整體穩態交接~Whole-system steady-state handoff','用同一污泥批次比較藥量、帶速、捕集率、含固率與清洗水。~Compare polymer, belt speed, capture, cake solids and washwater on the same sludge batch.','跨污泥種類比較單一乾度造成錯誤選型。~Comparing cake solids across different sludges misguides selection.','泥餅最乾的機型永遠總成本最低。~The driest-cake machine always has lowest total cost.','residual')])
course(435,'水分蒸發、熱回收與乾燥系統邊界~Evaporation, heat recovery and dryer system boundaries',['dry','gas','sludge'],[
u('濕乾基分辨~Wet and dry bases','先固定乾固體庫存，再用進出含固率計算需移除的水。~Fix dry-solids inventory before calculating water removal from inlet/outlet solids fractions.','把濕基含水率直接當乾基含水比。~Wet-basis moisture is mistaken for dry-basis moisture ratio.','含水率與含固率可不註明基準。~Moisture and solids fractions need no basis.','feedsolids'),
u('蒸發水量~Evaporated-water balance','乾燥主要減少水而非乾固體，產品濕重隨含固率非線性變化。~Drying primarily removes water, not dry solids; wet mass changes nonlinearly with solids fraction.','未列粉塵與揮發損失就宣稱固體全守恆。~Ignoring dust/volatile losses overstates exact solids conservation.','產品減重全部等於有機物分解。~All product mass loss is organic decomposition.','evap'),
u('汽化潛熱~Latent-heat requirement','把蒸發潛熱與升溫顯熱分開，才知道熱回收改善哪一部分。~Separate evaporation latent heat from sensible heating to locate heat-recovery benefits.','只算顯熱會大幅漏掉乾燥熱需求。~Sensible heat alone misses much of drying demand.','把水加熱到目標溫度就不需汽化熱。~Reaching target temperature removes the need for latent heat.','latent'),
u('進料與產品顯熱~Feed and product sensible heat','進料、固體及設備的升溫都影響能耗，濕污泥可先用等效熱容估計。~Feed, solids and equipment heating affect demand; use an effective heat capacity for a first estimate.','把所有物質熱容當水且不揭露假設。~Assuming every heat capacity equals water without disclosure is misleading.','顯熱永遠可以忽略。~Sensible heat is always negligible.','heat'),
u('熱回收溫位~Heat-recovery temperature grade','冷凝熱可預熱進料，但其溫位可能不足以直接驅動高溫乾燥。~Condensation heat can preheat feed but may be too low-grade for direct high-temperature drying.','回收熱重複抵扣兩個單元。~Crediting the same recovered heat twice exaggerates savings.','回收的每一 MJ 都可完全替代高溫燃料熱。~Every recovered MJ fully replaces high-temperature fuel heat.','recoverheat'),
u('單位蒸發能耗~Energy per water evaporated','以每公斤蒸發水比較效能，並固定進出含固率與供熱邊界。~Compare per kilogram evaporated at matching solids fractions and heat boundaries.','以每噸濕污泥比較不同含水率。~Per-wet-tonne comparisons across different moisture contents mislead.','不同含水污泥的每噸能耗可直接比較。~Energy per wet tonne is directly comparable for any moisture.','dryersec'),
u('預脫水的熱效益~Thermal benefit of pre-dewatering','機械去水通常先降低後段蒸發量，但也須計入機械用電與聚合物。~Mechanical dewatering reduces later evaporation, while electricity and polymer remain part of the balance.','只看乾燥機而漏掉前段改善。~A dryer-only view misses upstream improvement.','進料含固率不影響乾燥需熱。~Feed solids fraction does not affect heat demand.','evap'),
u('沼氣熱值邊界~Biogas heating-value basis','熱供應取決於甲烷份額與標準化體積，總氣量不能直接當燃料能量。~Heat supply depends on methane fraction and normalized volume, not total gas volume alone.','濕氣量未校正即估熱值。~Uncorrected wet-gas volume distorts energy.','總沼氣均可當純甲烷估熱。~All biogas can be treated as pure methane.','methanefrac'),
u('凝結水與尾氣~Condensate and exhaust','水離開固體後進入凝結水或尾氣，仍須追蹤污染物與回流負荷。~Removed water enters condensate/exhaust; contaminants and recycle loading still need tracking.','把蒸發當作污染物全部消除。~Evaporation is incorrectly equated with pollutant destruction.','乾燥後所有污染物都消失。~Drying destroys all pollutants.','dew'),
u('能源、品質與防護交接~Energy, quality and protection handoff','完整方案同時列淨能源、產品品質與粉塵／熱設備防護，數值練習僅在離線模型進行。~The handoff covers net energy, product quality and dust/thermal safeguards; numerical exercises stay offline.','只提高乾度卻忽略產品粉塵與系統能耗。~Maximizing dryness overlooks dust and total energy.','最乾產品必定是所有目的的最佳方案。~The driest product is optimal for every purpose.','chpnet')])
course(436,'沼氣污染物分離、甲烷回收與淨能源~Biogas contaminant separation, methane recovery and net energy',['gas','digestion'],[
u('乾基氣量與甲烷分率~Dry-gas volume and methane fraction','先統一乾濕基、溫度與壓力，再把總沼氣換成甲烷量。~Normalize moisture, temperature and pressure before converting biogas to methane volume.','不同標準狀態的流量被直接相加。~Flows at different reference states are added directly.','任何條件的氣體體積都可直接比較。~Gas volumes are comparable at any condition.','methanefrac'),
u('水分與冷凝~Moisture and condensation','冷凝降低含濕量，但露點必須以出口壓力及溫度驗證。~Condensation lowers moisture, but validate dew point at outlet pressure/temperature.','排出冷凝水就宣稱完全乾燥。~Collected condensate does not prove complete drying.','看到冷凝水就代表出口露點合格。~Visible condensate proves acceptable outlet dew point.','dew'),
u('硫化氫吸附床~Hydrogen-sulfide sorbent bed','介質容量與傳質區共同影響突破，床前後分析比固定更換日數可靠。~Capacity and mass-transfer zones govern breakthrough; inlet/outlet analysis outperforms a fixed calendar.','只依介質名義容量估壽命。~Nominal capacity alone overpredicts service life.','吸附床在容量用完前絕不會突破。~An adsorber cannot break through before its nominal capacity is used.','adsorb'),
u('矽氧烷與設備沉積~Siloxanes and equipment deposition','矽氧烷污染須用適當分析確認，不能由甲烷純度推論已去除。~Verify siloxanes analytically; methane purity does not establish their removal.','只量 H2S 就忽略矽氧烷。~Measuring H2S alone misses siloxanes.','甲烷純度高就不需要查微量污染物。~High methane purity removes the need for trace-contaminant tests.','adsorb'),
u('二氧化碳分離~Carbon-dioxide separation','去除 CO2 提升甲烷比例，但不會創造新的甲烷分子。~Removing CO2 raises methane fraction without creating methane molecules.','用產品氣純度上升宣稱甲烷產量同幅增加。~Higher product purity is mistaken for equal methane-production growth.','去除 CO2 就會增加甲烷總質量。~Removing CO2 increases total methane mass.','methanefrac'),
u('甲烷滑漏~Methane slip','尾氣中的甲烷損失影響回收率與排放，需跟產品純度分開報告。~Methane in tail gas affects recovery/emissions and must be reported separately from purity.','只公布純度而隱藏尾氣流量。~Purity-only reporting hides tail-gas losses.','產品純度高等於甲烷回收率高。~High purity equals high methane recovery.','gasloss'),
u('儲氣與用氣配對~Storage and demand matching','產氣與用氣時間不同，儲氣及安全去向決定可利用程度。~Different generation/demand timing makes storage and safe alternative routing decisive.','將日產氣全當同時可供發電。~Daily gas total is treated as instantly available.','日產氣量足夠就不必檢查時間匹配。~Adequate daily gas eliminates timing concerns.','gasenergy'),
u('發電熱值基準~Generation heating-value basis','把標準化甲烷能量乘轉換效率，並避免高低熱值混用。~Apply conversion efficiency to normalized methane energy without mixing higher/lower heating values.','效率與熱值採不同基準而虛增收益。~Mismatched efficiency/heating-value bases inflate benefits.','用高熱值或低熱值都不影響效率比較。~Higher versus lower heating value does not affect efficiency comparisons.','gasenergy'),
u('輔機與淨能源~Auxiliaries and net energy','壓縮、乾燥與循環泵消耗部分回收能源，分表才能知道淨收益。~Compression, drying and circulation consume recovered energy; submeter to determine net benefit.','用毛發電替代可輸出淨電。~Gross generation is mistaken for net export.','發電機電表就是整套系統淨發電。~The generator meter equals whole-system net generation.','chpnet'),
u('成分及維護交接~Composition and maintenance handoff','交接紀錄包含水分、H2S、矽氧烷、甲烷純度與滑漏的分析方法。~Handoff records include methods for moisture, H2S, siloxanes, methane purity and slip.','以一次合格樣本替代長期突破監測。~One passing sample replaces long-term breakthrough monitoring.','一次樣本可證明吸附床永久有效。~One sample proves permanent adsorber performance.','breakthrough')])
course(437,'溶氧需求、傳質效率與鼓風系統最佳化~Oxygen demand, transfer efficiency and blower optimization',['energy','ontario','nutrient'],[
u('能耗量測邊界~Energy-metering boundary','先分開曝氣、混合及其他用電，建立相同水質要求下的基準。~Separate aeration, mixing and other electricity at matching treatment requirements.','用全廠電表推論單台鼓風機改善。~A whole-plant meter cannot isolate one blower improvement.','只看總電量即可比較曝氣效率。~Total electricity alone compares aeration efficiency.','energy'),
u('硝化氧需求盤點~Nitrification oxygen demand','氨氮轉化需氧與碳氧化需氧分列，避免把出水惡化當需求降低。~Separate nitrification/carbon demands and do not mistake degraded effluent for lower demand.','省電同時氨氮上升卻未報告。~Energy savings are reported while ammonium rises.','少送氧必定代表效率提升。~Less oxygen delivery always means higher efficiency.','nito2'),
u('污水修正係數~Wastewater correction factor','污水界面活性成分會改變傳質，清水額定值須經現場修正。~Wastewater constituents alter transfer, requiring correction of clean-water ratings.','將清水效率直接用於高固體污水。~Clean-water efficiency is applied directly to high-solids wastewater.','清水和污水的 kLa 永遠相同。~Clean-water and wastewater kLa are always identical.','alpha'),
u('溶氧驅動差~Oxygen driving difference','DO 過高減小飽和濃度與水中濃度差，會降低同條件的傳質驅動力。~Excess DO reduces the saturation-to-liquid difference and the transfer driving force.','把高 DO 當作唯一良好控制指標。~High DO is treated as the only good-control indicator.','DO 越高同一 kLa 的轉氧越快。~Higher DO increases transfer at the same kLa.','otr'),
u('空氣需求~Air requirement','氧需求要經含氧量及傳移效率換算成氣量，不能直接把公斤當立方米。~Convert oxygen mass through air oxygen content and transfer efficiency to air volume.','空氣標準狀態沒有一致化。~Air reference conditions are not harmonized.','一公斤氧需求就是一立方米空氣。~One kilogram of oxygen demand equals one cubic meter of air.','airreq'),
u('DO 感測可信度~Credible DO measurement','探頭偏差影響供氣指令，先排除污染與校正問題再調控制。~Sensor bias changes air commands; eliminate fouling/calibration problems before retuning.','補償錯誤探頭造成長期過曝氣。~Compensating a biased probe causes chronic over-aeration.','自動控制能自動修正所有量測錯誤。~Automatic control fixes every measurement error.','calib'),
u('轉氧比能率~Oxygen-transfer energy efficiency','比較單位電力真正轉入的氧，並將控制效果與設備效率分開。~Compare oxygen actually transferred per electricity and separate control effects from equipment efficiency.','只看鼓風量而沒有轉氧證據。~Airflow is compared without oxygen-transfer evidence.','送風量越多代表比能率越好。~More airflow means better energy efficiency.','oxygenenergy'),
u('分區回流與混合~Zonal recycle and mixing','回流攜氧可侵入缺氧段；降低曝氣也不能犧牲必要的混合。~Recycle oxygen can enter anoxic zones; reduced aeration must not sacrifice necessary mixing.','把混合所需動力全部當浪費。~All mixing power is incorrectly labeled waste.','降低所有混合動力總是有益。~Reducing all mixing power is always beneficial.','recycle'),
u('尖峰與低負荷情境~Peak and low-load scenarios','鼓風設備調節範圍須涵蓋負荷變動，平均工況不能代表全天。~Blower turndown must span loading changes; average conditions do not describe a day.','低負荷依舊固定高供氣。~High fixed air persists during low loading.','平均需氧足以決定全天供氣。~Average oxygen demand determines all-day air supply.','peakratio'),
u('節能驗收~Energy-saving acceptance','驗收同時比較出水、污泥與能源，使用可重播的前後相近負荷時段。~Accept savings using comparable replayable periods and checking effluent, sludge and energy.','前後水量不同使每度電比較失真。~Different before/after flows distort electricity comparisons.','電費降低即可證明處理改善。~A lower bill proves improved treatment.','energy')])
course(438,'沉降、水力分配與初沉污泥收支~Settling, flow distribution and primary-sludge balance',['clarifier','training','nutrient'],[
u('懸浮固體進流~Influent suspended-solids loading','初沉池去除可沉固體，負荷需以 TSS、沉降性與流量共同界定。~Primary clarification targets settleable solids; define loading with TSS, settleability and flow.','只看濁度替代固體質量。~Turbidity is used as a substitute for solids mass.','濁度值可直接當 kg 固體負荷。~Turbidity directly gives kilograms of solids load.','load'),
u('沉降速度與池深~Settling velocity and depth','理想粒子沉降提供量級，但污水絮凝讓粒徑與沉速沿途改變。~Ideal settling gives scale, while flocculation changes particle size and velocity en route.','把單一粒子速率當全部污泥行為。~One-particle velocity is taken as all sludge behavior.','所有顆粒都有相同沉速。~Every particle has the same settling velocity.','settle'),
u('表面溢流率~Surface overflow rate','面積與水量決定表面水力負荷，增加深度並不直接降低這項指標。~Area and flow determine surface hydraulic loading; depth does not directly lower it.','只加深卻以為表面負荷降低。~Deepening alone is assumed to reduce surface loading.','池深加倍就使表面溢流率減半。~Doubling depth halves surface overflow rate.','sor'),
u('有效停留與短流~Effective residence and bypass','進流消能、擋板與出流配置會影響短流，示蹤比單看 V/Q 更有資訊。~Inlet dissipation, baffles and outlets influence bypass; tracing reveals more than V/Q alone.','角落死水與中間高速流並存。~Dead corners coexist with a fast central path.','平均停留時間長就沒有短流。~Long mean residence eliminates bypass.','hrt'),
u('出水堰分配~Effluent-weir distribution','堰頂標高與局部負荷影響均勻出流，維護不平會吸走局部絮體。~Weir level and local loading control distribution; uneven crests draw local floc.','長堰未調平仍發生偏流。~A long unlevel weir still causes maldistribution.','堰越長就不用調平。~Longer weirs need no leveling.','weir'),
u('有機物去除與後段~Organic removal and downstream demand','初沉去除有機物可減少曝氣負荷，也可能減少後段反硝化碳。~Primary organic removal can reduce aeration demand and downstream denitrification carbon.','只追求最大初沉去除而忽略後段需要。~Maximizing primary removal ignores downstream needs.','初沉去除率最高永遠最有利。~Maximum primary removal is always best.','removal'),
u('污泥排出基準~Sludge-withdrawal basis','排泥需用固體質量閉合，濃度與體積變動不能單獨判讀。~Close sludge removal on a solids-mass basis; concentration and volume alone are insufficient.','排出體積增加但濃度下降。~Withdrawal volume rises while solids concentration falls.','多排一倍體積就多排一倍乾固體。~Twice the sludge volume always removes twice the dry solids.','feedsolids'),
u('尖峰水力情境~Peak hydraulic scenario','雨天峰流可能比平均水量更影響固體逃逸，需重播峰值歷線。~Wet-weather peaks can drive solids escape more than mean flow; replay hydrographs.','以日均流量判定短時超載。~Daily mean flow is used to judge brief overload.','日均流量不高就不會水力超載。~Low daily average prevents hydraulic overload.','peakratio'),
u('污泥與上清混合~Sludge and supernatant mixing','回流水的溶解有機物與固體須重新納入進流，不可當作無負荷清水。~Return liquids add dissolved organics/solids and are not load-free water.','旁流接回入口但未納入採樣。~Returned sidestreams are excluded from sampling.','廠內回流水不增加處理負荷。~Internal returns add no treatment load.','mix'),
u('固體去向驗證~Solids-destination verification','把進流、出水、污泥與槽內庫存閉合，分辨真去除與暫時沉積。~Close influent, effluent, sludge and inventory to distinguish removal from temporary deposition.','槽內堆積被誤當穩定去除。~Accumulation is mistaken for steady removal.','沉到池底就永遠離開系統。~Settling to the floor permanently removes solids from the system.','residual')])
course(439,'二沉池固體通量、泥毯與回排泥~Secondary-clarifier solids flux, blanket and sludge return/wasting',['nutrient','training','clarifier'],[
u('混合液固體進入~Mixed-liquor solids input','二沉池處理混合液與回流循環的固體通量，不能只看出流水量。~Secondary clarification handles mixed-liquor/recycle solids flux, not effluent flow alone.','漏算回流造成固體負荷低估。~Omitting recycle understates solids loading.','固體負荷只由進廠水量決定。~Plant influent flow alone determines clarifier solids loading.','solidsload'),
u('沉降指標與曲線~Settleability and curves','SVI 是批次指標，須搭配完整沉降曲線與濃度，避免單數值定性。~SVI is a batch indicator; pair it with a full curve and concentration rather than labeling from one number.','高濃度阻礙沉降被錯認為絲狀菌膨化。~Concentration-hindered settling is mistaken for filamentous bulking.','同一 SVI 代表相同污泥性質。~The same SVI means identical sludge properties.','svi'),
u('回流濃度平衡~Return-sludge concentration balance','回流量與回流濃度共同維持菌體循環，池底庫存仍需獨立追蹤。~Return flow and concentration maintain biomass cycling while blanket inventory needs separate tracking.','只增加回流而未看沉澱能力。~Increasing recycle without checking settling capacity fails.','回流增加永遠降低固體負荷。~More recycle always lowers solids loading.','ras'),
u('水力與固體雙限制~Hydraulic and solids constraints','表面水力負荷與固體通量是不同限制，任一不足都可能帶出污泥。~Hydraulic overflow and solids flux are distinct constraints; either can cause sludge escape.','水力尚可便宣布二沉池安全。~Acceptable hydraulics alone is mistaken for sufficient performance.','表面溢流率低就不會固體超載。~Low overflow rate prevents solids overload.','sor'),
u('泥毯庫存變動~Sludge-blanket inventory change','泥毯上升可能代表固體進入大於移出，需把高度轉成體積及質量趨勢。~Rising blanket can indicate accumulation; convert height to volume/mass trends.','單支探頭的局部高點被當整池平均。~One local probe peak is treated as the whole-pool mean.','泥毯高度就是固體質量。~Blanket height equals solids mass.','blanket'),
u('回流與排泥分工~Return versus wasting','回流重分配菌體，排泥改變全系統固體年齡，兩種操作不可互換。~Return redistributes biomass; wasting changes system solids age, so the two are not interchangeable.','用回流量替代排泥質量計算污泥齡。~Recycle volume substitutes for wasted mass in SRT.','回流與排泥具有完全相同功能。~Return and waste sludge have identical functions.','srt'),
u('出水顆粒攜磷~Effluent solids carrying phosphorus','固體流失同時攜帶有機物與磷，水相反應正常仍可能出水不良。~Escaping solids carry organics/P even when aqueous reactions work well.','只查正磷酸鹽忽略 TSS。~Orthophosphate-only analysis misses TSS-related P.','生物吸磷好就不用檢查沉澱池。~Good biological uptake eliminates clarifier checks.','partp'),
u('出水堰及偏流~Weirs and uneven flow','均勻溢流有助減少局部高流速，堰上附著與高程誤差都需檢查。~Uniform discharge limits local velocities; inspect deposits and elevation errors.','只清潔池面而未檢查堰分配。~Surface cleaning overlooks weir distribution.','出水堰局部流量不會影響固體逃逸。~Local weir flow never affects solids escape.','weir'),
u('雨天增流重播~Wet-weather replay','在同一固體濃度下增加流量，檢查泥毯、通量及出水峰值。~Increase flow at fixed solids concentration and inspect blanket, flux and effluent peaks.','只考慮平均固體濃度而漏掉瞬時流量。~Average solids obscure instantaneous flow effects.','濃度不變就沒有新增沉澱負擔。~Unchanged concentration means no extra clarifier burden.','peakratio'),
u('診斷與固體閉合~Diagnosis and solids closure','由顯微、沉降、流量與泥毯證據區分膨化、上浮、短流及超載。~Use microscopy, settling, flow and blanket evidence to distinguish bulking, rising sludge, bypass and overload.','相同濁出水被全部歸因同一菌相。~Every turbid effluent is blamed on the same biology.','所有出水固體異常都應只增加回流。~Every effluent-solids fault is solved by more recycle.','residual')])
course(440,'降雨入流、截流調蓄與事件質量~Rain inflow, interception, storage and event mass',['cso','csoreport'],[
u('雨污合流邊界~Combined-sewer boundary','分開旱天污水與降雨逕流，才可辨識截流、儲存及處理的共同限制。~Separate dry-weather wastewater and runoff to identify interception, storage and treatment constraints.','將雨天稀釋當作沒有污染負荷。~Wet-weather dilution is mistaken for no pollution load.','雨水混入後就只剩乾淨水。~Adding rain leaves only clean water.','mix'),
u('集水面積與雨量~Catchment and rainfall','先用事件雨深估總量，再用歷線描述進流時間；總量與峰值不可混同。~Estimate event volume from rain depth, then use hydrographs for timing; volume is not peak flow.','單一逕流係數跨乾濕條件不變。~One runoff coefficient is assumed for all wetness states.','相同雨量必有相同峰值流量。~Equal rainfall depth gives identical peak flow.','runoff'),
u('截流與儲槽收支~Interception and storage balance','累積進出流量差決定儲量，截流增加也受下游處理限制。~Accumulated inflow-outflow difference sets storage; interception remains constrained downstream.','截流管加大但下游處理無法承接。~Larger interception overwhelms downstream treatment.','截流越多就不必考慮處理能力。~More interception removes the need to check treatment capacity.','storage'),
u('峰值與事件時間~Peak and event timescale','短時峰可能超過管渠與泵能力，即使一天總量仍有餘裕。~Brief peaks can exceed sewer/pump capacity despite spare daily volume.','日平均掩蓋短時間溢流。~Daily averaging hides brief overflows.','日平均不超量就不會溢流。~Acceptable daily mean prevents overflow.','peakratio'),
u('污染初期與採樣~First-flush behavior and sampling','初期沖刷需由時間序列驗證，不可假設每個事件都相同。~Verify first-flush behavior from time series rather than assuming it for every event.','只有雨後樣本漏掉污染尖峰。~Post-storm-only samples miss pollutant peaks.','第一場雨的一個樣本可代表所有事件。~One first-storm sample represents all events.','eventload'),
u('暫存後排空~Post-event drawdown','排空速度要與持續進流及下游能力相配，避免把溢流轉移到下一處。~Match drawdown to continuing inflow/downstream capacity to avoid moving the overflow elsewhere.','排空過快造成處理廠新峰值。~Rapid emptying creates a new plant peak.','儲槽越快排空永遠越好。~Faster storage emptying is always better.','drawdown'),
u('固體沉積與清理~Deposits and cleaning','調蓄降低流速也會沉積固體，有效儲量隨沉積而減少。~Storage slows flow and deposits solids, reducing usable volume.','以完工容積當多年後有效容積。~As-built volume is treated as current usable storage.','調蓄槽容積永遠不會改變。~Storage usable volume never changes.','settle'),
u('控制閘門情境~Gate-control scenarios','離線重播閘門延遲與感測偏差，檢查上下游水位而非只看本地量。~Replay gate delay/sensor bias offline and inspect upstream/downstream levels, not just local readings.','改善本地水位卻造成上游回堵。~Local improvement creates upstream surcharge.','本地水位下降就代表全網改善。~Lower local level proves network improvement.','calib'),
u('溢流質量與成效~Overflow mass and effectiveness','以溢流體積及流量加權濃度算事件負荷，事件數減少不必然等於質量等比減少。~Calculate event load from volume and weighted concentration; fewer events need not mean proportional mass reduction.','只以事件次數宣稱全部污染減幅。~Event counts alone are used to claim mass reduction.','溢流次數減半就必定減少一半污染質量。~Halving event count halves pollutant mass.','eventload'),
u('聯合驗證與維護~Integrated validation and maintenance','比較雨量、截流量、儲槽水位、排放與下游出水，保留所有未量測項。~Compare rainfall, interception, storage level, discharge and downstream effluent, retaining unmeasured terms.','儲量差額被當作自動去污。~Unclosed storage is mistaken for pollutant treatment.','存進儲槽就已完成污染物去除。~Stored water has already had pollutants removed.','residual')])

# Additional course-specific teaching calculations; all values are hypothetical.
m('sulfload','Q=800 m³/d；總溶解硫化物=4 mg S/L~Q=800 m³/d; total dissolved sulfide=4 mg S/L','LS=QC/1000','800*4/1000','kg S/d','硫基準水相負荷，不是空氣中 H2S 濃度；採樣須避免氧化與揮發損失。~Aqueous sulfur-basis load, not airborne H2S concentration; sampling must prevent oxidation and volatilization loss.','採樣保存與分析方法成對記錄，對比流量加權樣本。~Record preservation and analytical methods together and compare flow-weighted samples.','C:4→6 mg S/L','800*6/1000')
m('gasload','氣體流量=500 m³/h；濃度=20 mg/m³~Gas flow=500 m³/h; concentration=20 mg/m³','M=QC/1000000','500*20/1000000','kg/h','氣體體積與濃度須在同一溫壓基準；不可把 mg/m³ 當 ppm。~Gas volume and concentration require the same temperature/pressure basis; mg/m³ is not ppm.','同步量氣體流量、溫壓及成分，確認採樣代表性。~Synchronize gas flow, temperature, pressure and composition and verify representative sampling.','C:20→30 mg/m³','500*30/1000000')
m('gasbreak','入口 C0=100 mg/m³；出口 C=10 mg/m³~Inlet C0=100 mg/m³; outlet C=10 mg/m³','B=C/C0','10/100','fraction','同溫壓同成分的氣相穿透比，不是職業暴露或燃氣品質合格判定。~Gas breakthrough ratio for the same species and volume basis, not occupational-exposure or fuel-quality compliance.','比對床前床後同時採樣與氣體分析校正。~Compare simultaneous upstream/downstream samples and gas-analyzer calibration.','C:10→25 mg/m³','25/100')
m('pumpdecline','相同揚程下基線流量=0.050 m³/s；目前=0.040 m³/s~Baseline flow at matched head=0.050 m³/s; current flow=0.040 m³/s','r=Qnow/Qbase','.040/.050','fraction','須先配對轉速、揚程、液性與儀器狀態；不能單憑流量下降診斷纏繞。~First match speed, head, fluid properties and instrument condition; reduced flow alone does not diagnose ragging.','把流量、吸排壓、轉速、電流與振動放在同一時間軸。~Place flow, suction/discharge pressure, speed, current and vibration on one timeline.','Qnow:0.040→0.035 m³/s','.035/.050')
m('surfacecoverage','已檢查管內壁面積=60 m²；目標面積=100 m²~Inspected internal surface=60 m²; target area=100 m²','coverage=Ainspected/Atarget','60/100','fraction','只表示檢查覆蓋率；未檢查區域不能假定完好。~Inspection coverage only; uninspected regions cannot be assumed sound.','將遠端影像、厚度測點與管段里程對齊，標示遮蔽區。~Align remote imagery and thickness measurements to chainage and mark occluded regions.','Ainspected:60→80 m²','80/100')
m('uvtime','有效通水體積=0.3 m³；Q=0.02 m³/s~Effective wetted volume=0.3 m³; Q=0.02 m³/s','t=V/Q','.3/.02','s','名義通過時間不等於最低受光時間；燈場與流速分布需驗證。~Nominal passage time is not minimum UV exposure time; lamp field and velocity distribution require validation.','配對流量與水位，另以示蹤或驗證資料檢查短流。~Pair flow with water level and check short-circuiting using tracer or validation data.','Q:0.02→0.025 m³/s','.3/.025')
m('indicatorload','流量=1000 m³/d；指標菌=100 CFU/100 mL~Flow=1000 m³/d; indicator organisms=100 CFU/100 mL','Nday=Q×10000×C','1000*10000*100','CFU/d','只計培養法的指標菌通量；不能直接推成所有病原或感染風險。~Culture-based indicator-organism flux only, not all pathogens or infection risk.','記錄檢出限、培養法與採樣時刻，避免把未檢出當零。~Record detection limit, culture method and sample time; do not equate nondetection to zero.','Q:1000→1200 m³/d','1200*10000*100')
m('byproduct','假想前驅物=100 µg/L；表觀轉化質量比例=0.05~Hypothetical precursor=100 µg/L; apparent mass-conversion fraction=0.05','Cby=Y×Cprecursor','.05*100','µg/L','只是敏感度算術，不是臭氧副產物的動力學或化學計量預測；比例需由中試資料辨識。~Sensitivity arithmetic only, not ozone-byproduct kinetics or stoichiometry; identify the fraction from pilot data.','以相同方法測前驅物、目標副產物及其檢出限。~Measure precursor, target byproduct and detection limits using consistent methods.','Y:0.05→0.08','.08*100')
m('dgstock','有效容積=1000 m³；乾固體濃度=40 kg/m³~Effective volume=1000 m³; dry-solids concentration=40 kg/m³','MDS=VC','1000*40','kg DS','混合均勻的庫存近似；不能由總庫存推定混合均勻。~Inventory approximation for a mixed vessel; total inventory does not prove mixing uniformity.','比較不同深度與位置的乾固體濃度並扣除沉積死區。~Compare dry-solids concentration by depth/location and account for deposited dead zones.','C:40→45 kg/m³','1000*45')
m('dewaterenergy','脫水用電=400 kWh/d；乾固體處理量=2000 kg DS/d~Dewatering electricity=400 kWh/d; dry solids processed=2000 kg DS/d','SEC=E/MDS','400/2000','kWh/kg DS','包含相同的進料、主機及附屬設備邊界；同時比較泥餅與固體回收率。~Use identical feed, machine and auxiliary boundaries; compare cake dryness and solids capture too.','同步讀電表、乾固體進料與泥餅含固率。~Synchronize electricity, dry-solids feed and cake solids measurements.','E:400→350 kWh/d','350/2000')
m('beltwater','沖洗水流量=2 m³/h；每日沖洗運轉=8 h~Wash-water flow=2 m³/h; daily washing operation=8 h','Vwash=Qt','2*8','m³/d','只有水量收支，不是噴嘴壓力或衛生保證；回流水負荷仍需採樣。~Water balance only, not nozzle-pressure or hygienic assurance; sample return-stream loads separately.','以獨立沖洗支線水表與運轉紀錄交叉核對。~Cross-check a dedicated wash-water meter with operating logs.','t:8→10 h','2*10')

course(441,'濕井、格柵、泵曲線與堵塞預兆~Wet wells, screens, pump curves and clogging precursors',['pump','energy','csoreport'],[
u('來水與纖維物辨識~Influent and fibrous-material mapping','把濕紙巾、纖維、砂與油脂分開標記；不同堵塞物需要不同前端攔截與維護證據。~Tag wipes, fibers, grit and grease separately; their clogging mechanisms require different screening and maintenance evidence.','只記堵塞次數而不記堵塞物種類與位置。~Only event counts are recorded, without material type or location.','所有堵塞都只是泵馬力太小。~Every clog is simply insufficient motor power.','blockarea'),
u('格柵有效通水面積~Effective screen flow area','攔污減少自由面積，可能提高局部速度與水頭損失；應看前後水位差而非只看表面乾淨。~Retained material reduces open area and can increase local velocity/head loss; inspect level difference, not appearance alone.','纖維薄層遮住網孔卻被視為無大物體。~A thin fiber mat covers openings but is dismissed because no large object is visible.','看不到大垃圾就沒有格柵阻塞。~No visible large debris means no screen blockage.','blockarea'),
u('壓力管流速情境~Force-main velocity scenarios','流量與管徑決定平均速度，低流速沉積與高流速損失需分開評估；速度不是纖維通過保證。~Flow and diameter set mean velocity; deposition and high-velocity losses require separate assessment, and velocity does not guarantee fiber passage.','平均速度足夠卻忽略彎頭局部掛料。~Adequate mean velocity hides snagging at fittings.','有足夠平均流速就永遠不堵塞。~Adequate mean velocity prevents every clog.','velocity'),
u('濕井庫存與停留~Wet-well inventory and residence','液位變化反映進出流量差；過長停留可能影響沉積與水質，計算只作離線情境。~Level change reflects inflow minus outflow; extended retention can affect deposits and water quality, explored offline here.','使用總井深而非可用容積估時間。~Total depth replaces usable storage in the time estimate.','容積除流量就是可保證的停電容忍時間。~Volume divided by flow guarantees allowable outage duration.','wetwell'),
u('揚程與輸送功率~Head and pumping power','水力功率由流量、揚程與效率決定，關閉閥或堵塞改變工作點，不能只比較電流。~Flow, head and efficiency determine pumping power; throttling or clogging moves the duty point, so current alone is insufficient.','把電流下降誤判為節能成功。~Lower current is misread as successful energy savings.','耗電變小就代表輸送表現更好。~Lower electricity always means better conveyance.','power'),
u('基線與堵塞前兆~Baseline and clogging precursors','在相同轉速與揚程配對流量、電流及振動，可篩出纏繞、磨耗或感測偏差的不同假說。~Match flow, current and vibration at equal speed/head to distinguish ragging, wear and sensor-bias hypotheses.','不同雨天與旱天工作點直接比較。~Wet- and dry-weather duty points are compared without normalization.','流量下降可以單獨證明葉輪纏繞。~Reduced flow alone proves impeller ragging.','pumpdecline'),
u('並聯與備援能力~Parallel operation and redundancy','以一台不可用的情境估剩餘能力，再回到共同管線系統曲線核對。~Estimate capacity with one unit unavailable, then check the shared-pipe system curve.','把每台銘牌流量相加當實際並聯流量。~Nameplate flows are added as if they were actual parallel output.','兩台泵必定得到單台兩倍流量。~Two pumps always deliver twice one-pump flow.','redundancy'),
u('清理與機械隔離~Cleaning and mechanical isolation','模擬清理需要先辨識能源與回流路徑，實機由合格人員依隔離程序操作；完成後以配對工作點驗證恢復。~Simulated cleaning first identifies energy and backflow paths; qualified staff use site isolation procedures, then verify recovery at matched duty points.','把畫面停機當作所有能量已隔離。~A stopped screen display is mistaken for complete energy isolation.','遠端停機訊號等於可接觸葉輪。~A remote stop signal makes the impeller safe to touch.','pumpdecline'),
u('雨峰與故障重播~Storm-peak and failure replay','把峰流、單機停用與液位感測失準分開注入數位情境，檢查溢流與備援限制。~Inject peak inflow, unit outage and level-sensor bias separately in the digital scenario to test overflow and redundancy constraints.','同時更動所有輸入而無法辨識失效原因。~Changing all inputs together prevents fault attribution.','只有平均流量需要納入泵站驗證。~Only average inflow matters for pump-station verification.','peakratio'),
u('全生命週期成效~Lifecycle performance evidence','以堵塞事件、可用率、輸送量與每立方米能耗共同評估，避免將頻繁人工清理藏在節能數字後。~Assess clogs, availability, conveyed volume and specific electricity together so energy metrics do not conceal repeated manual cleaning.','節省電力但溢流與維護工時增加。~Electricity falls while overflows and maintenance hours rise.','最低單位能耗就是最佳泵站方案。~Lowest specific energy alone identifies the best station.','energy')])
course(442,'硫化物生成、逸散、腐蝕證據與控制邊界~Sulfide generation, release, corrosion evidence and control boundaries',['corrosion','pump','gas'],[
u('厭氧停留與來源~Anaerobic retention and sources','有機物與硫酸鹽在缺氧管段可形成硫化物；先畫長停留區、壓力管及跌水點，再談控制。~Organic matter and sulfate can support sulfide formation in anaerobic reaches; map retention zones, force mains and drops before selecting control.','只檢查臭味出口而未追溯上游生成區。~Only the odor outlet is checked, leaving upstream generation unmapped.','腐蝕只能在聞到臭味的位置開始。~Corrosion can begin only where odor is noticed.','hrt'),
u('總硫化物水相負荷~Total aqueous sulfide load','先統一硫質量基準，採樣保存不當會讓氧化或揮發被誤認為真去除。~Use a common sulfur-mass basis; poor sample preservation can make oxidation or volatilization appear to be treatment.','硫與 H2S 分子質量混用。~Sulfur mass and H2S molecular mass are mixed.','相同數字的 mg S/L 與 mg H2S/L 等價。~Equal numerical mg S/L and mg H2S/L values are equivalent.','sulfload'),
u('pH 與水相分配~pH and aqueous speciation','未解離 H2S 比例受 pH 與溫度影響；此平衡不會直接給出呼吸高度的氣體濃度。~The undissociated H2S fraction depends on pH and temperature; aqueous equilibrium does not directly give breathing-zone concentration.','把水相 H2S 算式當作空氣安全證明。~An aqueous-H2S calculation is used as proof of air safety.','水相硫化物低就不需要氣體量測。~Low aqueous sulfide removes the need for gas measurement.','h2sfrac'),
u('跌水逸散與氣相量測~Release at drops and gas monitoring','紊流、溫度與氣液接觸會影響逸散；氣相負荷需由同時的風量與濃度計算。~Turbulence, temperature and gas-liquid contact affect release; gas load needs simultaneous airflow and concentration.','不同溫壓條件的氣體數字直接相乘。~Gas measurements from different reference conditions are multiplied directly.','氣體 ppm 可直接代入 mg/m³ 的質量式。~Gas ppm can be directly substituted for mg/m³.','gasload'),
u('冠部酸蝕與材料損失~Crown acid attack and material loss','潮濕管冠的生物氧化可能造成酸蝕；用連續厚度與表面紀錄辨識進展，而非單張照片。~Biological oxidation on a damp crown can cause acid attack; track thickness and surface condition over time, not a single image.','沉積層厚度被當作完整結構厚度。~Deposit thickness is confused with sound structural thickness.','外觀沒有破洞就沒有腐蝕損失。~No visible hole means no corrosion loss.','corrosionrate'),
u('通風與密閉空間邊界~Ventilation and confined-space boundaries','換氣次數只描述平均空氣交換；死角、持續產氣與感測位置仍決定暴露。遊戲不提供入井許可。~Air changes describe average exchange; dead zones, continuing generation and sensor placement govern exposure. The game grants no confined-space entry authorization.','以鼻子是否聞到判斷 H2S 是否存在。~Smell is used to decide whether H2S is present.','計算換氣次數足夠就可自行入井。~A calculated air-change rate authorizes entry.','airchanges'),
u('源頭控制方案比較~Comparing source-control options','比較縮短停留、降低生成、捕集與化學處理的邊界；質量換算不能替代現場試驗及副作用評估。~Compare retention reduction, generation control, capture and chemical treatment boundaries; mass conversion does not replace site trials or side-effect assessment.','只看臭味變少而未量總硫及下游影響。~Reduced odor is accepted without sulfur or downstream checks.','任何去味處理都會把硫元素消失。~Every odor-control process makes sulfur disappear.','dose'),
u('內襯與檢查覆蓋~Lining and inspection coverage','保護層連續性、接縫與基底狀況影響耐久性；遠端檢查須標出未覆蓋面積。~Lining continuity, joints and substrate condition affect durability; remote inspection must identify unexamined area.','有影像的區域完好便推定全管完好。~Sound photographed areas are taken as proof that the whole pipe is sound.','檢查覆蓋率等於腐蝕防護有效率。~Inspection coverage equals corrosion-protection effectiveness.','surfacecoverage'),
u('處理床穿透監測~Treatment-bed breakthrough','氣相吸附或反應床需追蹤床前後同成分比例；處理效率與人員暴露判定各有量測邊界。~Track matching upstream/downstream gas species across adsorption/reactive beds; treatment efficiency and exposure have separate monitoring boundaries.','只量出口但未知道入口負荷上升。~Only the outlet is measured, hiding rising inlet load.','去除九成就必定符合所有排放與暴露要求。~Ninety-percent removal meets every emission and exposure requirement.','gasbreak'),
u('腐蝕控制成效回訪~Follow-up of corrosion control','以相同管段、季節條件及測點比較硫負荷、氣相與材料損失，辨識改善是否持續。~Compare sulfide load, gas and material loss at matched reaches, seasons and points to determine whether improvement persists.','短期低臭味被當作多年壽命保證。~Short-term odor reduction is treated as a multiyear life guarantee.','歷史平均腐蝕速率可以無條件預測剩餘壽命。~Historical mean corrosion rate unconditionally predicts remaining life.','corrosionrate')])
course(443,'UV 透光、流場、劑量與驗證範圍~UV transmission, hydraulics, fluence and validation envelope',['uv','lt2','training'],[
u('前處理與指標菌基線~Pretreatment and indicator baseline','消毒目標需區分指標菌與病原；流量和採樣方法決定如何比較處理前後結果。~Distinguish indicator organisms from pathogens; flow and sampling methods determine valid before/after comparisons.','用單一指標菌檢測宣稱所有病原已消失。~One indicator test is used to claim elimination of all pathogens.','清澈的出水等於不需要消毒。~Clear effluent does not need disinfection.','indicatorload'),
u('透光率與光程~Transmittance and optical path','UVT 必須標明波長與光程；同一水樣的更長光程會衰減更多光。~UVT requires wavelength and path length; longer paths through the same water attenuate more light.','把 1 cm UVT 當作整座反應器的透光率。~One-centimeter UVT is treated as whole-reactor transmittance.','UVT 是與光程無關的固定百分比。~UVT is a fixed percentage independent of path length.','uvtrans'),
u('照度與時間乘積~Irradiance and exposure time','均勻場中的 E×t 只教會劑量單位，實際微生物路徑經歷的光強不相同。~E×t in a uniform field teaches fluence units; actual microorganism trajectories encounter different intensities.','以燈具銘牌功率直接當水中照度。~Lamp nameplate power is substituted for in-water irradiance.','單一 E×t 計算就是反應器驗證劑量。~One E×t calculation is the validated reactor dose.','uvdose'),
u('水力通道與短流~Hydraulic paths and short-circuiting','水位、流量及擋板決定停留分布，名義體積不能辨識繞過燈區的快流。~Level, flow and baffles determine residence distribution; nominal volume does not reveal fast paths bypassing lamps.','平均通過時間掩蓋最低曝光路徑。~Mean passage time hides minimum-exposure paths.','平均停留時間足夠就所有水都足夠受光。~Adequate mean residence ensures adequate exposure for all water.','uvtime'),
u('燈老化與套管污垢~Lamp aging and sleeve fouling','燈輸出衰退與套管污垢會共同降低水中照度，兩者需分開診斷與維護紀錄。~Aging lamps and fouled sleeves both reduce in-water irradiance and require separate diagnosis and maintenance records.','清套管後仍低輸出卻忽略老化或感測漂移。~Low output after cleaning is attributed only to residual fouling, ignoring aging or sensor drift.','只要燈亮就保持原始消毒能力。~A lit lamp retains its original disinfection capability.','lamp'),
u('顆粒遮蔽與水質變動~Particle shielding and water-quality change','附著於顆粒內部的微生物可能受遮蔽；低濁度與高 UVT 仍需搭配顆粒及微生物證據。~Microbes within particles can be shielded; low turbidity and high UVT still require particle and microbiological evidence.','只以濁度預測所有 UV 表現。~Turbidity alone is used to predict all UV performance.','相同 UVT 的兩種水必有相同消毒效果。~Two waters with equal UVT necessarily have equal disinfection.','uvtrans'),
u('生物驗證與對數降低~Biodosimetry and log reduction','用指定挑戰微生物及受控條件驗證反應器，再與校正曲線相連；檢測方法決定可聲稱的降低量。~Validate with specified challenge organisms and controlled conditions linked to a calibration curve; the analytical method limits the claimed reduction.','未檢出結果被直接代為零而算無限降低。~Nondetection is entered as zero to claim infinite reduction.','指標菌降低量可以不加修正套用所有病原。~Indicator reduction transfers unchanged to every pathogen.','logrem'),
u('驗證包絡與負載~Validation envelope and loading','可用的運轉區間由經驗證的流量、UVT、燈組與感測條件組成，超出時不能靠外插宣稱達標。~The usable envelope combines validated flow, UVT, lamp configuration and sensing; extrapolation outside it does not prove compliance.','日平均流量在範圍內就忽略瞬時超量。~An acceptable daily mean hides instantaneous excursions.','提高流量後只按平均劑量比例換算就足夠。~Scaling mean fluence with flow is enough after a flow increase.','uvtime'),
u('感測、警報與失效演練~Sensing, alarms and failure rehearsal','離線注入感測偏差、燈組失效與水質突變，檢查警報如何保留異常時段及處理去向。~Inject sensor bias, lamp failure and water-quality changes offline to check alarms, exceptional intervals and water routing.','警報消音被當作水質已恢復。~Acknowledging an alarm is mistaken for restored treatment.','只有讀值偏低才需要檢查感測器。~Only low readings require sensor checks.','lamp'),
u('採樣驗收與追溯~Sampling verification and traceability','配對進出水採樣、流量與 UVT／燈狀態，保留檢出限與失效時段，才能解釋降低量。~Pair inlet/outlet samples with flow, UVT and lamp state, retaining detection limits and fault intervals to interpret reduction.','不同日期或不同水團樣本直接相減。~Samples from different days or water parcels are directly compared.','一次合格樣本保證整個運轉期間合格。~One passing sample guarantees the whole operating period.','logrem')])
course(444,'臭氧氣液傳質、需求、反應與副產物~Ozone gas-liquid transfer, demand, reaction and byproducts',['ozone','dwtech','lt2'],[
u('處理目的與前驅物~Treatment goals and precursors','先區分消毒、色味或特定化合物氧化目標；不同水質的臭氧需求與副產物路徑不同。~Separate disinfection, color/odor and target-compound oxidation goals; ozone demand and byproduct pathways depend on water quality.','只以去色當所有污染物已去除。~Decolorization is used to claim removal of all contaminants.','顏色消失等於所有有機碳礦化。~Loss of color means all organic carbon is mineralized.','removal'),
u('原料氣與乾燥邊界~Feed-gas conditioning boundary','發生器需要相容的原料氣與冷卻條件；乾燥只是一個子程序，不能讓學徒操作高壓電或氣體系統。~Generators require compatible feed gas and cooling; drying is one subsystem, and the learner does not operate high-voltage or gas equipment.','把除去部分冷凝水誤認為已符合設備乾燥需求。~Partial condensate removal is mistaken for meeting equipment dryness requirements.','量到冷凝水就足以證明露點合格。~Collected condensate alone proves an acceptable dew point.','dew'),
u('產生、注入與尾氣~Generation, injection and off-gas','用產生量、尾氣與水相殘留區分傳入水中與實際反應；氣體產量不等於有效處理量。~Separate generated ozone, off-gas and aqueous residual to distinguish transferred ozone from reacted ozone.','只以發生器輸出估算水中有效劑量。~Generator output alone is used as effective aqueous dose.','產生的臭氧百分之百都會溶入水中。~All generated ozone dissolves in water.','ozonemass'),
u('需求與殘留衰減~Demand and residual decay','天然有機物與其他還原物會消耗臭氧；簡化一階模型要由實測殘留時間曲線檢查。~Natural organic matter and other reductants consume ozone; test a first-order approximation against residual-time data.','以清水的衰減係數套到不同原水。~A clean-water decay coefficient is applied to another source water.','投加後殘留永遠保持固定。~Residual remains constant after dosing.','decay'),
u('接觸池與 CT~Contactor hydraulics and CT','有效接觸時間來自示蹤與水力條件，CT 應使用相應區段殘留而非單純名義槽容。~Effective contact time depends on tracer/hydraulic evidence; CT uses the relevant compartment residual, not nominal volume alone.','將平均停留時間當最短有效接觸時間。~Mean residence is treated as minimum effective contact time.','相同 C×t 在任何水質與病原上都等效。~Equal C×t is universally equivalent across waters and organisms.','ct'),
u('目標轉化與礦化~Target transformation versus mineralization','母體濃度下降可能只是轉化成其他產物，需另外量總有機碳與目標產物。~Declining parent-compound concentration may reflect transformation, requiring separate total-organic-carbon and product measurements.','母體去除率直接稱為礦化率。~Parent removal is labeled mineralization.','氧化一定把所有污染物變成二氧化碳和水。~Oxidation always turns every contaminant into carbon dioxide and water.','removal'),
u('副產物敏感度~Byproduct sensitivity','含溴原水等情境需評估特定副產物；使用假想比例只練習敏感度，實際必須靠中試與分析。~Bromide-containing waters require specific byproduct assessment; a hypothetical fraction teaches sensitivity, while actual prediction requires pilot testing and analysis.','只提高臭氧以追求母體去除而不測副產物。~Ozone is increased for parent removal without measuring byproducts.','臭氧自行分解就代表不可能有反應副產物。~Ozone decomposition means reaction byproducts cannot occur.','byproduct'),
u('尾氣破壞與監測~Off-gas destruction and monitoring','尾氣處理要追蹤入口負荷與出口濃度；設備效率不能替代環境氣體偵測及隔離程序。~Track inlet load and outlet concentration across off-gas treatment; equipment efficiency does not replace ambient monitoring and isolation procedures.','只看尾氣處理設備有通電。~Powered equipment is mistaken for verified off-gas treatment.','無氣味可作為臭氧氣體安全證據。~Absence of odor proves ozone-gas safety.','gasbreak'),
u('後續生物或碳處理~Downstream biological or carbon treatment','氧化可改變可生物利用性，後續過濾或活性碳需量自己的負荷與穿透，不能沿用前段去除率。~Oxidation can change biodegradability; downstream filtration/carbon needs its own loading and breakthrough measurements.','把前段氧化成效當後段長期容量。~Upstream oxidation performance is treated as downstream lifetime capacity.','增加可生物分解性就是已經去除有機碳。~Greater biodegradability means organic carbon has already been removed.','carboncap'),
u('水質與能耗共同驗證~Joint water-quality and energy verification','在相同水量與原水背景比較目標物、殘留、副產物及總能耗，保持實際驗證範圍。~Compare targets, residual, byproducts and total electricity at matched flow/source quality while retaining the validated envelope.','用電降低卻忽略接觸不足與副產物。~Lower power conceals inadequate contact and byproducts.','最低臭氧能耗永遠是最佳水處理結果。~Lowest ozone energy always gives the best treatment outcome.','energy')])
course(445,'原水特性、瓶杯試驗、混凝與絮體成長~Raw-water characteristics, jar tests, coagulation and floc growth',['coag','filter','dwtech'],[
u('原水變化與處理目的~Source variability and treatment goals','分開濁度、色度、天然有機物、pH 與鹼度；同一濁度不代表相同凝聚需求。~Separate turbidity, color, natural organic matter, pH and alkalinity; equal turbidity does not imply equal coagulation demand.','只依原水濁度線性決定藥量。~Dose is determined only by a linear turbidity relationship.','濁度是顆粒質量的通用直接換算。~Turbidity universally converts directly to particle mass.','load'),
u('瓶杯試驗比較設計~Jar-test comparison design','用同批原水控制混合與沉降時間，只改一項劑量或條件，並量殘濁及溶解有機物。~Use one source-water batch with controlled mixing/settling, vary one dose or condition, and measure residual turbidity and dissolved organics.','同時改藥劑、pH 與時間而宣稱單因素效果。~Reagent, pH and time are changed together but interpreted as one-factor effects.','最大的可見絮體必定是最佳條件。~The largest visible flocs always indicate the best condition.','jar'),
u('活性成分與投加質量~Active ingredient and dosing mass','把瓶杯試驗的活性成分濃度轉為質量需求，再確認商用藥液濃度，避免元素與產品基準混用。~Convert active-ingredient concentration to mass demand, then check commercial solution strength without mixing elemental and product bases.','把標示溶液重量當活性成分重量。~Solution mass is mistaken for active-ingredient mass.','相同 mg/L 的不同藥品代表相同化學作用。~Equal mg/L of different products means identical chemistry.','dose'),
u('儲液與計量泵換算~Solution and metering-pump conversion','藥液質量分率、密度與泵標定共同決定體積供應；計算後還要用實測消耗驗證。~Mass fraction, density and pump calibration determine solution volume; verify the calculation against measured consumption.','換了濃度卻沿用原體積設定。~A changed solution strength retains the old volumetric setting.','泵轉速百分比直接等於活性藥量百分比。~Pump-speed percentage directly equals active-dose percentage.','solution'),
u('快混分散與局部剪切~Rapid dispersion and local shear','快速分散讓水解及電荷中和在適當位置發生；平均 G 不顯示短路與局部極端剪切。~Rapid dispersion places hydrolysis/charge neutralization appropriately; mean G does not reveal bypass or local shear extremes.','以平均功率足夠就忽略藥點混合死角。~Adequate mean power hides dead zones near injection.','攪拌器功率越大越能無限制改善混凝。~More mixer power improves coagulation without limit.','mixpower'),
u('膠凝碰撞與停留~Flocculation collisions and residence','適度碰撞使失穩粒子成長，G 與時間應一起看，同時觀察絮體強度和分級混合。~Controlled collisions grow destabilized particles; assess G and time together with floc strength and staged mixing.','只延長時間而忽略後段剪切破碎。~Longer time is assumed beneficial despite downstream breakup.','相同 Gt 必定產生相同絮體。~Equal Gt necessarily produces identical flocs.','gt'),
u('輸送破碎與復原~Transfer breakup and recovery','絮凝後彎頭、泵或跌水可能破壞絮體；用相同水樣比較前後沉降與過濾結果。~Bends, pumps or drops after flocculation may break flocs; compare settling/filtering before and after transfer using matched water.','瓶杯試驗很好便忽略實廠輸送剪切。~Good jar results lead to ignoring full-scale transfer shear.','絮體一旦生成就不受後續流動影響。~Once formed, flocs are unaffected by downstream hydraulics.','jar'),
u('澄清負荷與沉降~Clarifier loading and settling','絮體必須在有限水力時間內分離；表面負荷與沉降試驗共同界定澄清表現。~Flocs must separate within available hydraulics; overflow loading and settling tests jointly describe clarification.','只追求化學去除而忽略池體短流。~Chemical removal is optimized while hydraulic bypass is ignored.','成功混凝就代表沉澱池一定成功。~Successful coagulation guarantees successful clarification.','sor'),
u('後續過濾連結~Link to downstream filtration','澄清殘留顆粒會影響濾程、濁度與反洗量；最佳混凝方案要看完整處理鏈。~Residual clarified particles affect filter run length, turbidity and backwashing; assess coagulation across the whole treatment chain.','只以澄清池出水最低濁度判定整廠最優。~Lowest clarifier turbidity alone is used to identify the plant optimum.','濾池可無限補救上游絮凝不足。~Filters can indefinitely compensate for inadequate flocculation.','rate'),
u('殘餘物與驗證報告~Residuals and verification report','把水相成分、污泥及庫存列入收支，確認去除是移到殘餘物而非物質消失。~Account for aqueous constituents, sludge and inventory to show that removal transfers material to residuals rather than making it disappear.','忽略污泥增加與處置需求。~Additional sludge and residual management are omitted.','水清了就不必追蹤凝聚污泥。~Clear water removes the need to track coagulation sludge.','residual')])

m('filterhead','濾速 v=5 m/h；床深 L=0.8 m；假想水力傳導係數 K=5 m/h~Filtration velocity v=5 m/h; bed depth L=0.8 m; hypothetical hydraulic conductivity K=5 m/h','Δh=vL/K','5*.8/5','m','飽和、近似線性 Darcy 關係的教學例；堵塞、分層及非線性流動需另外描述。~Teaching example of saturated near-linear Darcy flow; fouling, layering and nonlinear flow require additional description.','比較進出測壓管水頭並記錄水溫與流量。~Compare inlet/outlet piezometric heads and record temperature and flow.','K:5→4 m/h','5*.8/4')
m('filterpore','孔隙率=0.4；床深=0.8 m；濾速=5 m/h~Porosity=0.4; bed depth=0.8 m; filtration velocity=5 m/h','tpore=60εL/v','60*.4*.8/5','min','均勻飽和床層孔隙停留時間；不是顆粒捕集效率或消毒接觸時間。~Uniform saturated-bed pore residence time, not capture efficiency or disinfection contact time.','以床層實測厚度、孔隙估計與示蹤曲線交叉檢查。~Cross-check measured bed depth and estimated porosity against tracer curves.','v:5→6 m/h','60*.4*.8/6')
m('filterrun','濾水量=100 m³/h；一個濾程=24 h~Filtration flow=100 m³/h; one run=24 h','Vrun=Qt','100*24','m³/run','只計毛產水；停洗時間、初濾排放與反洗水另扣。~Gross production only; subtract washing downtime, filter-to-waste and backwash water separately.','同步記錄濾程起訖、流量、初濾排放與水質。~Synchronize run start/end, flow, filter-to-waste and quality records.','t:24→20 h','100*20')
m('sandvolume','平面面積=40 m²；砂床厚度=0.8 m~Plan area=40 m²; sand depth=0.8 m','Vsand=A×L','40*.8','m³ bulk media','幾何體積不等於採購質量；壓實、含水、級配及補充庫存另列。~Geometric volume is not procurement mass; allow separately for packing, moisture, grading and replenishment.','量完成面積與多點砂深，並核對材料檢驗紀錄。~Measure finished plan area and sand depth at multiple locations and check material-test records.','L:0.8→0.9 m','40*.9')
m('grading','D60=0.45 mm；D10=0.20 mm~D60=0.45 mm; D10=0.20 mm','UC=D60/D10','.45/.20','ratio','粒徑為累積通過曲線讀值；UC 不是孔徑，更不是病原阻擋尺寸。~Grain diameters come from cumulative passing curves; UC is neither pore size nor pathogen-cutoff size.','重畫篩分析曲線並以插值核對 D10、D60。~Replot sieve results and check interpolated D10 and D60.','D60:0.45→0.50 mm','.50/.20')
m('slowhead','濾速=0.1 m/h；砂深=0.8 m；假想 K=0.4 m/h~Velocity=0.1 m/h; sand depth=0.8 m; hypothetical K=0.4 m/h','Δh=vL/K','.1*.8/.4','m','乾淨飽和床層的 Darcy 近似，表面生物膜阻力及非均勻堵塞未包含。~Darcy approximation for a clean saturated bed, excluding surface-biofilm resistance and uneven clogging.','以多層測壓資料區分表面及深床壓損。~Use multi-level piezometry to distinguish surface and deep-bed head loss.','K:0.4→0.25 m/h','.1*.8/.25')
m('freundlich','假想 K=2 (mg/g)/(mg/L)^0.5；C=0.10 mg/L；1/n=0.5~Hypothetical K=2 (mg/g)/(mg/L)^0.5; C=0.10 mg/L; 1/n=0.5','q=K C^(1/n)','2*.10**.5','mg/g','同溫度單溶質平衡擬合；不能直接預測多成分動態床壽命。~Same-temperature single-solute equilibrium fit; it does not directly predict multisolute dynamic-bed life.','以平衡批次數據擬合並用未參與擬合的濃度點驗證。~Fit equilibrium batch data and validate with held-out concentration points.','C:0.10→0.20 mg/L','2*.20**.5')
m('gacload','Q=500 m³/d；目標物=20 µg/L~Q=500 m³/d; target compound=20 µg/L','L=QC/1000000','500*20/1000000','kg/d','微克至公斤換算；不可把背景 DOC 當作同一種目標物。~Microgram-to-kilogram conversion; background DOC is not the same target compound.','採流量加權目標物樣本，保留分析檢出限與空白。~Collect flow-weighted target-compound samples with detection limits and blanks.','C:20→30 µg/L','500*30/1000000')
m('leaktest','假想隔離測試壓差由 30 降至 28 kPa；時間=2 min~Hypothetical isolated-test pressure falls from 30 to 28 kPa over 2 min','r=(Pstart-Pend)/t','(30-28)/2','kPa/min','只計試驗衰減率，不提供膜壓力設定或合格門檻；溫度、洩漏路徑及測試方法須驗證。~Test-decay rate only, not a membrane-pressure setting or pass threshold; temperature, leakage paths and method require validation.','校正壓力與時間，記錄溫度並依設備核准方法定位洩漏。~Calibrate pressure/time, record temperature and locate leaks using the approved equipment method.','Pend:28→27 kPa','(30-27)/2')
m('ufnet','UF 毛產水=240 m³/d；反洗=12、排放=8 m³/d~UF gross permeate=240 m³/d; backwash=12, drain loss=8 m³/d','Qnet=Qgross-Qbw-Qdrain','240-12-8','m³/d','同一日與同一膜組邊界，旁流回收不能重複算作新產水。~Same day and membrane-train boundary; recycled sidestreams must not be counted twice as new production.','以各支線累積水表與槽位變化關閉水量收支。~Close the water balance using branch totalizers and tank-level changes.','Qbw:12→18 m³/d','240-18-8')
m('roenergy','進水=100 m³/h；壓差=12 bar；泵效率=0.8~Feed=100 m³/h; pressure difference=12 bar; pump efficiency=0.8','P=QΔP/(36η)','100*12/(36*.8)','kW','不可壓縮水及假想定效率；不含馬達損失、能源回收與附屬設備。~Incompressible water with assumed constant efficiency, excluding motor loss, energy recovery and auxiliaries.','同步記錄流量、壓差與電功率，核對量測邊界。~Synchronize flow, pressure difference and electrical power and check measurement boundaries.','ΔP:12→14 bar','100*14/(36*.8)')
m('concfactor','回收率 R=0.75；假設目標鹽完全截留~Recovery R=0.75; assume complete rejection of the target salt','CF=1/(1-R)','1/(1-.75)','ratio','無沉澱且完全截留的理想濃縮比；濃差極化使膜面濃度可能更高。~Ideal concentration factor without precipitation and with complete rejection; concentration polarization can raise the membrane-surface value.','比較進水、濃水離子質量平衡與飽和指數，不只比電導率。~Compare feed/concentrate ion balances and saturation indices, not conductivity alone.','R:0.75→0.80','1/(1-.80)')
m('saltflux','Q=100 m³/h；溶解鹽=1000 mg/L~Q=100 m³/h; dissolved salts=1000 mg/L','Ms=QC/1000','100*1000/1000','kg salts/h','同一離子或同一定義總鹽基準；電導率需水樣特定關係才能轉濃度。~Use the same ion or defined total-salt basis; conductivity requires a water-specific concentration relationship.','採進水、產水、濃水並記錄溫度及各離子分析。~Sample feed, permeate and concentrate with temperature and ion analyses.','C:1000→1200 mg/L','100*1200/1000')
m('normflux','實測通量=55 LMH；假想溫度修正乘數=1.10~Measured flux=55 LMH; hypothetical temperature multiplier=1.10','Jref=Jmeasured/TCF','55/1.10','LMH','只是已知乘數的換算示例；實際修正需依膜型、壓力與鹽度共同正規化。~Known-multiplier conversion only; real normalization depends on membrane type, pressure and salinity together.','用同一膜型的核准正規化方法，保留原始溫壓與鹽度。~Use the approved normalization method for that membrane type and retain raw temperature, pressure and salinity.','TCF:1.10→1.05','55/1.05')

course(446,'濾程、水頭損失、床層膨脹與恢復~Filter runs, head loss, bed expansion and return to service',['filter','coag','training'],[
u('進水顆粒與濾速~Influent particles and filtration rate','快濾承接前段處理後的顆粒；以實際啟用面積計濾速，不能把停用池算入。~Rapid filters receive particles after upstream treatment; use active area rather than including offline cells in the loading calculation.','一池反洗時仍用全廠面積算濾速。~All installed area is used while one cell is backwashing.','相同總流量代表每池負荷不變。~Equal total flow means unchanged load in each cell.','rate'),
u('床層與孔隙水~Bed and pore water','砂、無煙煤或其他濾料的層深與孔隙影響通道，孔隙停留時間本身不表示捕集率。~Media depth and porosity influence flow paths; pore residence time alone does not establish capture efficiency.','把砂床總體積當作全是水的體積。~Bulk bed volume is treated as water volume.','水通過孔隙的時間就等於消毒時間。~Pore passage time equals disinfection contact time.','filterpore'),
u('累積壓損與截污~Head-loss growth and retained solids','顆粒沉積降低通水能力；分層測壓可辨識表面堵塞、深層截污或流量改變。~Deposits reduce permeability; multi-level pressure measurements distinguish surface plugging, depth loading and changed flow.','壓差上升全歸因濾料堵塞而漏掉流量增加。~Every pressure rise is blamed on fouling while increased flow is missed.','壓損高代表濾出水必定更乾淨。~Higher head loss necessarily means cleaner filtrate.','filterhead'),
u('濾程終點比較~Comparing run endpoints','濁度穿透、水頭限制與時間限制是不同觸發條件，需比較水質與可用產水。~Turbidity breakthrough, head limits and elapsed time are distinct triggers requiring quality and usable-production comparison.','只追求最長運轉時間而忽略穿透。~Longest runtime is pursued despite breakthrough.','濾程越長永遠越節水。~A longer run always saves water.','filterrun'),
u('反洗用水收支~Backwash-water balance','反洗強度與時間轉為用水體積；此算式不會給出適用於任何濾料的反洗速率。~Intensity and time determine backwash volume; this calculation supplies no universally suitable wash rate.','將其他濾料或水溫的反洗條件直接複用。~Wash conditions are copied across different media or temperatures.','相同反洗水量一定有相同清洗效果。~Equal backwash volume guarantees equal cleaning.','backwash'),
u('床層膨脹量測~Measuring bed expansion','量反洗前後床高並比較多個位置，檢查流體化是否均勻及是否有濾料流失。~Measure bed height before/during backwash at several locations to assess uniform fluidization and media loss.','只看單一角落的床層高度。~Only one corner of the bed is observed.','膨脹越大就越能保證清潔與完整。~More expansion always guarantees cleaner, intact media.','expand'),
u('氣水順序與配水~Air-water sequence and distribution','離線演練各設備順序及連鎖，依核准設備程序檢查配水不均；不把教學數值當閥門設定。~Rehearse sequencing/interlocks offline and assess uneven distribution against approved equipment procedures; teaching values are not valve settings.','同一總水量掩蓋局部噴流與死角。~Equal total wash flow hides local jets and dead zones.','總反洗流量正常就表示每處受洗相同。~Normal total backwash flow means uniform cleaning everywhere.','expand'),
u('初濾排放與成熟~Filter-to-waste and ripening','反洗後顆粒截留狀態會變動，回到供水前須依實際驗證條件檢查連續水質。~Capture conditions change after washing; verify continuous quality against actual validated requirements before returning water to supply.','以反洗結束時間直接判定水質恢復。~Wash completion time is used as proof of restored quality.','反洗完成就必定可立刻進入清水池。~Backwash completion always permits immediate delivery to the clearwell.','jar'),
u('廢水回收與淨產水~Waste recycle and net production','扣掉反洗與初濾排放後再算淨產水，回收流需納入上游污染與水力負荷。~Subtract backwash/filter-to-waste for net production and include recycle pollutant/hydraulic loads upstream.','循環水重複算成新產水。~Recycled water is counted repeatedly as new production.','反洗回收不會增加任何上游負荷。~Backwash recycle adds no upstream burden.','netwater'),
u('維護後多指標驗證~Multi-indicator verification after maintenance','同時比較壓損、濁度、床層深度、濾程與淨產水，才能區分洗淨、通道化及濾料流失。~Compare head loss, turbidity, media depth, run duration and net production to distinguish cleaning, channeling and media loss.','壓損降低被當作唯一清洗成功證據。~Lower head loss is the sole evidence of successful cleaning.','更低壓損一定代表濾池恢復良好。~Lower head loss always means a well-restored filter.','filterhead')])
course(447,'慢砂構造、級配、生物成熟與刮砂復原~Slow-sand construction, grading, biological ripening and scraping recovery',['filter','dwtech','training'],[
u('原水適用性與前處理~Source suitability and pretreatment','慢砂依賴水力與生物作用，原水顆粒、溫度與有機物波動會改變堵塞與成熟狀態。~Slow sand combines hydraulic and biological processes; particles, temperature and organics affect clogging and ripening.','高濁事件仍假設平日負荷與濾程。~A high-turbidity event is assumed to have normal loading and run length.','慢砂可在任何原水下維持相同表現。~Slow sand performs identically with any source water.','slowrate'),
u('池體尺寸與材料數量~Cell geometry and material quantities','先確認有效濾面、可維護性與備援，再由砂深估材料幾何體積；這不等於結構設計。~Establish active area, maintainability and redundancy before estimating geometric sand volume; this is not structural design.','只按砂體積建造而未留出排水與維護空間。~Construction follows sand volume alone without drainage or maintenance space.','算出砂量就完成整座濾池工程設計。~Calculating sand volume completes the filter engineering design.','sandvolume'),
u('篩分析與級配驗收~Sieve analysis and grading acceptance','由完整通過曲線讀 D10、D60，確認材料一致性；均勻係數不能取代全部規格。~Read D10/D60 from the full passing curve to check consistency; uniformity coefficient does not replace the full specification.','只比一個粒徑平均值。~Only a mean grain size is compared.','砂粒直徑就是濾水孔徑。~Grain diameter equals filtration pore diameter.','grading'),
u('承托與集水均勻性~Support and collection uniformity','承托層與集水系統須避免細砂流失及局部短路，完工檢查應結合分區水頭與流量。~Support layers/underdrains should prevent sand loss and bypass; commissioning compares zonal head and flow.','總出水正常卻忽略局部集中通流。~Normal total output hides localized flow concentration.','總流量合格就代表底部配水完全均勻。~Passing total flow proves uniform underdrain distribution.','slowhead'),
u('水層與孔隙停留~Water layer and pore residence','維持床層條件要辨識上覆水與孔隙水，名義停留量化接觸機會，不能預測生物成熟。~Distinguish supernatant and pore water; nominal residence describes contact opportunity, not biological maturity.','把池內全部水量當成均等的有效生物接觸。~All water volume is treated as equally effective biological contact.','增加水深就能立即補足未成熟的生物層。~Greater water depth instantly compensates for an immature biological layer.','poretime'),
u('生物層建立與證據~Biofilm establishment and evidence','表層生物群落會隨原水與環境建立；應用連續水質證據判讀成熟，而非只等固定日數。~Surface communities develop with source water and environment; assess ripening from sustained quality evidence, not a fixed waiting period alone.','新建或刮砂後直接沿用成熟濾床表現。~A new or scraped bed is assumed to retain mature-bed performance.','達到某個日數就一定成熟且可安全供水。~A fixed number of days guarantees maturity and safe supply.','logrem'),
u('緩慢增阻與水力限制~Progressive resistance and hydraulic limits','用多層水頭判別表面污堵與深床改變，濾速變化必須與水質及可用水頭一起看。~Use multi-level heads to distinguish surface clogging from deeper changes, assessing rate alongside quality and available head.','只增加水頭掩蓋堵塞趨勢。~Increasing head conceals clogging trends.','可用水頭越多就可無限制延長濾程。~More available head extends a run without limit.','slowhead'),
u('刮砂與材料庫存~Scraping and media inventory','維護只在適用程序下移除表層；記錄移除深度與剩餘砂深，計算補砂需求。~Approved maintenance removes the surface layer where appropriate; track removed and remaining depths to estimate replacement needs.','多次刮砂後仍使用初始砂深建模。~The initial bed depth remains in the model after repeated scraping.','刮去越多表砂就越容易恢復最佳效能。~Removing more surface sand always improves recovery.','scrape'),
u('復原期與出水去向~Recovery period and water routing','刮砂擾動生物與顆粒條件，復原期間以監測判定去向與備援需求，而非由遊戲代替許可。~Scraping disturbs biology and particles; monitored recovery determines routing and reserve needs, not authorization from the game.','壓損恢復便忽略生物去除能力。~Restored head loss is mistaken for restored biological removal.','水流順暢即代表所有處理作用已恢復。~Free-flowing water means all treatment functions have recovered.','logrem'),
u('分池備援與長期記錄~Multiple-cell redundancy and long-term records','一池維護時用實際在線面積重算濾速，再核對水質、成熟度與砂層變化。~Recalculate loading from online area during maintenance and check quality, maturity and changing media depth.','維護造成在線面積減少卻仍按全池容量供水。~Reduced online area during maintenance is ignored in supply planning.','同一總面積可以不考慮各池成熟與停用狀態。~Total area makes individual cell maturity and downtime irrelevant.','slowrate')])
course(448,'吸附平衡、床層傳質、穿透與再生~Adsorption equilibrium, bed transfer, breakthrough and regeneration',['dwtech','filter','training'],[
u('目標物與競爭背景~Targets and competing background','辨識要控制的有機物、濃度單位及背景 DOC；不同目標物的吸附行為不能互相替代。~Identify target organics, concentration units and background DOC; adsorption behavior is not interchangeable among compounds.','用總有機碳數字代替特定微量污染物。~Total organic carbon substitutes for a specific trace contaminant.','所有有機物在活性碳上的親和力相同。~All organics have equal carbon affinity.','gacload'),
u('批次等溫線~Batch adsorption isotherms','平衡試驗建立濃度與碳負載關係；擬合範圍外與多成分競爭需另外驗證。~Equilibrium tests relate concentration to carbon loading; extrapolation and multicomponent competition need separate validation.','直接把單溶質平衡容量當動態床可用容量。~Single-solute equilibrium capacity is used as dynamic-bed capacity.','等溫線能單獨給出實際換碳日期。~An isotherm alone provides the actual replacement date.','freundlich'),
u('空床接觸時間~Empty-bed contact time','EBCT 用總床體積除流量，便於比較接觸條件；它不是孔隙停留時間。~EBCT divides bulk bed volume by flow for comparison; it is not pore-water residence time.','在 EBCT 又乘孔隙率造成定義混亂。~Porosity is inserted into EBCT, confusing definitions.','EBCT 與實際每個水粒子的接觸時間相同。~EBCT equals the actual contact time of every parcel.','ebct'),
u('處理床體積數~Treated bed volumes','累積處理量除床體積把不同規模試驗連結，但相同 BV 不代表相同污染負荷。~Cumulative volume divided by bed volume supports scale comparison, but equal BV does not imply equal contaminant load.','原水濃度改變仍用固定 BV 預測壽命。~A fixed BV life is used despite changed influent concentration.','相同 BV 的碳床一定達到相同飽和程度。~Beds at equal BV always have equal saturation.','bedvol'),
u('傳質區與穿透曲線~Mass-transfer zone and breakthrough curve','沿床深與時間的 C/C0 描述傳質區前進；出口單點不能看見整條曲線。~C/C0 versus depth/time describes the advancing mass-transfer zone; one outlet point does not reveal the whole curve.','只到出水明顯升高才建立第一筆資料。~Monitoring starts only after a large effluent rise.','穿透比例是獨立於原水濃度的飲水合格標準。~Breakthrough fraction is a drinking-water limit independent of inlet concentration.','breakthrough'),
u('容量與質量保守估計~Capacity and mass-based estimates','以假想工作容量與負荷估算上限量級，再用中試穿透修正，避免把材料比表面積當容量。~Use hypothetical working capacity/loading for an order-of-magnitude estimate and refine with pilot breakthrough, not surface area alone.','以新碳名稱或表面積保證固定壽命。~A carbon label or surface area is used to guarantee life.','廠商單一測試容量適用所有原水。~One material test capacity applies to every source water.','carboncap'),
u('多床串聯與採樣~Series beds and sampling','前後床分別採樣可觀察前床耗竭及後床保護，換床時仍需維持目標物證據。~Sampling each bed reveals lead-bed exhaustion and lag-bed protection; switching requires continued target-compound evidence.','只量總出口而不知道前床何時穿透。~Only final effluent is measured, hiding lead-bed breakthrough.','有兩床就可省略中間採樣。~Two beds eliminate intermediate sampling.','breakthrough'),
u('生物活性與壓損~Biological activity and head loss','生物生長可能改變有機物去除與氧需求，也可能增加壓損；需分開吸附與生物作用的證據。~Biology can alter organic removal and oxygen demand while increasing head loss; distinguish biological and adsorptive evidence.','碳床出水改善全歸因仍有大量吸附容量。~Improved effluent is attributed only to unused adsorption capacity.','生物活性代表不需要再關心穿透或衛生管理。~Biological activity eliminates breakthrough and hygiene concerns.','filterhead'),
u('換碳、再生與殘餘物~Replacement, regeneration and residuals','用目標物穿透、床層狀態及再生後驗證決定材料管理；污染物仍有處置去向。~Material management uses target breakthrough, bed condition and post-regeneration validation; captured contaminants still require a destination.','再生後僅看重量便宣稱全部性能恢復。~Recovered mass alone is used to claim restored performance.','再生可保證原始吸附能力百分之百恢復。~Regeneration guarantees full restoration of original capacity.','carboncap'),
u('成效與資料可追溯~Performance and data traceability','把累積流量、進出濃度、檢出限及換碳時間對齊，區分真正去除與原水自然下降。~Align cumulative flow, inlet/outlet concentration, detection limits and replacement dates to distinguish removal from a declining influent.','只有出口曲線就宣稱材料效能提升。~An outlet curve alone is used to claim improved media performance.','未檢出等於床層仍然完全未使用。~Nondetection means the bed remains completely unused.','bedvol')])
course(449,'UF 進水預處理、通量、完整性與淨產水~UF feed conditioning, flux, integrity and net production',['membrane','lt2','dwtech','ro'],[
u('進水組成與孔徑邊界~Feed constituents and separation boundary','區分懸浮顆粒、膠體、溶解鹽與有機物；UF 不會因為水變清就把所有溶解物去掉。~Separate particles, colloids, dissolved salts and organics; clarified UF permeate does not imply removal of all dissolved species.','以低濁度宣稱已完成脫鹽。~Low turbidity is used to claim desalination.','超濾膜是所有溶解物的絕對屏障。~UF is an absolute barrier to all dissolved substances.','removal'),
u('攔截與預處理試驗~Screening and pretreatment trials','預處理要保護纖維與流道；混凝等方案需測對通量、殘餘物與清洗相容性的影響。~Pretreatment protects fibers/channels; coagulation options require tests of flux, residuals and cleaning compatibility.','只看出水濁度而漏掉膜阻力快速上升。~Effluent turbidity is checked while rapidly rising membrane resistance is missed.','混凝產生越多絮體就一定越適合所有 UF。~More coagulation floc always benefits every UF system.','jar'),
u('膜面積與通量~Membrane area and flux','通量用產水除有效膜面積，並標明在線面積；同一總產水下停用膜組會提高其他膜負擔。~Flux is permeate per effective online area; taking trains offline raises loading on the remaining area at equal output.','以安裝總面積掩蓋停用膜組。~Installed area is used to hide offline trains.','相同產水量代表每支膜承受相同負荷。~Equal permeate output implies equal loading on each membrane.','flux'),
u('跨膜壓與壓力量測~Transmembrane pressure measurement','依流道定義取進水、濃水及產水壓力；單一入口壓力不一定是 TMP。~Use feed, concentrate and permeate pressures for the specified flow configuration; inlet pressure alone is not necessarily TMP.','忽略產水背壓而高估驅動力。~Permeate backpressure is ignored, overstating driving force.','進水壓力就是所有 UF 系統的跨膜壓。~Feed pressure is TMP in every UF system.','tmp'),
u('滲透率與溫度正規化~Permeability and temperature normalization','通量除 TMP 有助判讀阻力，但需配對水溫與模式，才能區分黏度變動與污染。~Flux/TMP helps assess resistance, but temperature and mode must be matched to distinguish viscosity changes from fouling.','冬季通量降低直接判斷不可逆污染。~Reduced winter flux is immediately labeled irreversible fouling.','滲透率變動只能由膜破損造成。~Only membrane damage can change permeability.','perm'),
u('反洗與淨水量~Backwashing and net water balance','毛產水扣掉反洗、排放與完整性測試耗水，才是可交付產水；回收不得重複計數。~Subtract backwash, drains and integrity-test water from gross permeate to obtain deliverable water without double-counting recycle.','只報瞬時通量掩蓋頻繁停洗損失。~Instantaneous flux hides frequent washing losses.','高瞬時通量必定提高每日淨產水。~Higher instantaneous flux always increases daily net production.','ufnet'),
u('直接完整性測試~Direct integrity testing','完整性檢查針對屏障洩漏，與清洗是否恢復通量是兩件事；測法與門檻依核准系統。~Integrity tests address barrier leakage separately from flux recovery; approved system methods and thresholds govern interpretation.','通量恢復便跳過完整性試驗。~Recovered flux leads to skipping integrity testing.','清洗後滲透率正常就證明沒有破纖。~Normal post-cleaning permeability proves no broken fibers.','leaktest'),
u('間接連續監測~Continuous indirect monitoring','濁度或粒子監測追蹤異常並觸發進一步確認；不能保證每種微小洩漏都被立即看到。~Turbidity/particle monitoring detects changes that trigger confirmation; it does not guarantee immediate detection of every small leak.','把沒有警報當成已完成直接完整性驗證。~No alarm is mistaken for completed direct integrity verification.','間接監測與直接完整性測試功能完全相同。~Indirect monitoring and direct integrity tests have identical roles.','logrem'),
u('清洗恢復與不可逆變化~Cleaning recovery and irreversible change','按相容性與已核准程序比較前後正規化滲透率，同時確認完整性，避免把高通量誤認為無損。~Compare normalized permeability under compatible approved cleaning procedures and verify integrity; high flux does not prove an intact membrane.','以更強清洗追求通量卻忽略材料老化。~Stronger cleaning pursues flux while ignoring material aging.','清洗後通量比新膜更高必定更好。~Flux above the new-membrane value is always better.','cleanrecovery'),
u('後段 RO 保護驗證~Verification of downstream RO protection','UF 出水仍須分析溶解鹽、可溶有機物及氧化劑等 RO 相容條件；完整前處理鏈需獨立驗證。~UF permeate still requires dissolved-salt, soluble-organic and oxidant checks for RO compatibility; validate the full pretreatment chain.','以 UF 濁度合格取代所有 RO 進水分析。~Passing UF turbidity replaces all RO feed analyses.','有 UF 前處理就不會發生 RO 結垢或生物污染。~UF pretreatment prevents all RO scaling and biofouling.','saltflux')])
course(450,'RO 回收率、鹽收支、驅動力與正規化診斷~RO recovery, salt balance, driving force and normalized diagnosis',['ro','dwtech','membrane'],[
u('進水分析與相容性~Feed analysis and compatibility','先取得離子、鹼度、溫度、顆粒、有機物與氧化劑資料；電導率不能取代結垢離子分析。~Obtain ions, alkalinity, temperature, particles, organics and oxidant data; conductivity does not replace scaling-ion analysis.','只用總鹽度挑選所有前處理。~Total salinity alone determines all pretreatment.','相同電導率就代表相同結垢與污染風險。~Equal conductivity means equal scaling and fouling risk.','saltflux'),
u('流股與回收率~Streams and recovery','辨識進水、產水與濃水，回收率描述分水比例；提高回收同時改變濃水與膜面條件。~Identify feed, permeate and concentrate; recovery describes water split, and increasing it changes concentrate and membrane-surface conditions.','回收率被當作鹽去除率。~Recovery is mistaken for salt rejection.','回收率越高就一定有更乾淨的產水。~Higher recovery always yields cleaner permeate.','recovery'),
u('截鹽率與濃度基準~Rejection and concentration basis','用相同成分與分析基準比較產水和進水；單一進水基準的表觀截留不同於膜面本徵性質。~Compare permeate and feed on a common species/analytical basis; feed-based apparent rejection differs from intrinsic membrane behavior.','以電導率比值當每個離子的精確截留率。~Conductivity ratio is treated as exact rejection for every ion.','高截鹽率保證所有微量物質都相同比例去除。~High salt rejection guarantees identical removal of all trace species.','rejection'),
u('濃水鹽質量閉合~Concentrate salt balance','進水鹽量分至產水及濃水；在準穩態無沉澱假設下由收支算濃水，並列未量測損失。~Feed salt divides between permeate and concentrate; compute concentrate under quasi-steady no-precipitation assumptions and report unmeasured terms.','直接把回收率倒數當實際濃水濃度。~Inverse recovery is used directly as concentrate concentration.','鹽被膜阻擋就從系統消失。~Rejected salt disappears from the system.','concentrate'),
u('滲透壓與淨驅動力~Osmotic pressure and net driving force','壓力差須扣掉滲透壓差才是近似淨驅動力；鹽濃度上升可降低產水而不一定是膜髒。~Subtract osmotic-pressure difference from hydraulic pressure difference for approximate net driving force; higher salinity can reduce output without fouling.','進水鹽度升高時只追查機械故障。~Only mechanical faults are investigated when feed salinity rises.','提高水壓的每一 bar 都完全變成有效滲透驅動力。~Every additional bar of water pressure becomes effective osmotic driving force.','ndp'),
u('段間濃縮與結垢~Interstage concentration and scaling','後段離子濃縮與膜面濃差極化不同；結垢需用離子活度與飽和狀態評估。~Interstage concentration and membrane-surface polarization differ; assess scaling with ion activities and saturation conditions.','以平均濃水濃度忽略局部膜面高濃度。~Average concentrate concentration hides higher membrane-surface values.','回收率相同就會有相同結垢風險。~Equal recovery gives equal scaling risk.','concfactor'),
u('壓力、功率與能源~Pressure, power and energy','輸送功率隨流量與壓差改變，完整能耗還須加前處理、附屬設備與能源回收的實測效果。~Pumping power varies with flow and pressure; total energy includes pretreatment, auxiliaries and measured recovery effects.','用水力功率當全廠電表值。~Hydraulic power is treated as plant electricity consumption.','單一高壓泵的效率就是整個水廠效率。~One high-pressure-pump efficiency is the whole-plant efficiency.','roenergy'),
u('正規化趨勢與診斷~Normalized trends and diagnosis','把產水、鹽透過與壓差放回共同溫度、壓力與鹽度基準，才能比較污染與季節變化。~Normalize output, salt passage and differential pressure to common temperature, pressure and salinity bases before comparing fouling and seasonality.','直接比冬夏原始產水量判定老化。~Raw summer/winter output is compared to diagnose aging.','溫度修正一個係數就能取代所有正規化步驟。~One temperature multiplier replaces all normalization.','normflux'),
u('清洗恢復與完整性~Cleaning recovery and integrity','根據診斷與膜相容性採核准程序，之後同看正規化流量、鹽透過與壓差，避免只追高產水。~Use approved procedures based on diagnosis/compatibility, then examine normalized flow, salt passage and differential pressure rather than output alone.','清洗後產水增加但截鹽率變差仍宣稱成功。~Higher output after cleaning is celebrated despite worse rejection.','只要產水恢復就證明膜沒有化學損傷。~Recovered output proves absence of chemical damage.','cleanrecovery'),
u('成品水、濃水與全鏈驗證~Product, concentrate and whole-chain verification','成品水依用途可能需後處理，濃水需合宜去向；RO 模組算式不能替代水質、許可與全廠驗證。~Product water may require post-treatment for its use and concentrate needs an appropriate destination; module calculations do not replace quality, permit or plant validation.','只報回收率與電導率而漏掉穩定性及濃水管理。~Recovery and conductivity are reported while stability and concentrate management are omitted.','RO 產水低鹽就必定已適合任何用途。~Low-salt RO permeate is automatically suitable for every use.','concentrate')])

# Match earlier course examples to the material/phase actually being taught.
FIXES={(431,7):'dgstock',(433,7):'dewaterenergy',(434,6):'beltwater',(436,9):'gasbreak',(436,6):'gasstorage',(440,7):'levelcalib',(445,0):'docload',(446,7):'filterwaste'}
for _n,_f,_s,_rows,_nodes in COURSES:
    for (_cn,_ui),_method in FIXES.items():
        if _n==_cn:
            _row=list(_rows[_ui]); _row[-1]=_method; _rows[_ui]=tuple(_row)



m('gasstorage','假想產氣=30、用氣=20 m³/h；時段=2 h~Hypothetical production=30, demand=20 m³/h; interval=2 h','ΔV=(Qprod-Quse)t','(30-20)*2','m³ reference gas','同一參考溫壓下的累積氣量差；不能直接當儲氣設備實際幾何容量或容許壓力。~Accumulated gas-volume difference at one reference condition; not vessel geometric capacity or permitted pressure.','量產用氣歷線、溫壓與其他氣體去向，逐時累積收支。~Measure production/demand traces, temperature/pressure and other destinations, then integrate hourly balances.','Quse:20→25 m³/h','(30-25)*2')
m('levelcalib','參考水位=0、2 m；讀值=0.05、1.95 m~Reference levels=0, 2 m; readings=0.05, 1.95 m','slope=(y2-y1)/(x2-x1)','(1.95-.05)/2','ratio','二點線性水位校正，不代表全量程或波動水面皆準確；須保留獨立驗證點。~Two-point linear level calibration does not establish full-range or fluctuating-surface accuracy; retain an independent check point.','核對高程基準、第三水位點與事件時間戳。~Check the elevation datum, a third level point and event timestamps.','y2:1.95→2.05 m','(2.05-.05)/2')
m('docload','Q=2000 m³/d；DOC=6 mg C/L~Q=2000 m³/d; DOC=6 mg C/L','LC=Q×DOC/1000','2000*6/1000','kg C/d','溶解有機碳負荷，不是濁度換算，也不單獨決定混凝藥量。~Dissolved-organic-carbon loading, not a turbidity conversion or a stand-alone coagulation-dose predictor.','以過濾樣本量 DOC，並同步量原水濁度、鹼度及 pH。~Measure DOC in filtered samples with concurrent source turbidity, alkalinity and pH.','DOC:6→8 mg C/L','2000*8/1000')
m('filterwaste','初濾排放流量=100 m³/h；假想持續=0.25 h~Filter-to-waste flow=100 m³/h; hypothetical duration=0.25 h','Vftw=Q×t','100*.25','m³','只計排放水量；持續時間不是水質達標門檻，實際回供需依監測及核准程序。~Waste-water volume only; duration is not a quality pass criterion, and return to supply requires monitoring/approved procedure.','對齊排放流量、連續濁度與閥位紀錄，辨識復原期。~Align waste flow, continuous turbidity and valve-state records to identify recovery.','t:0.25→0.40 h','100*.40')

