# Diagnostic response is model-specific and remains an offline teaching action.
RESPONSE={
'gasstorage':'逐時閉合產用氣，確認其他氣體去向與儲存參考狀態。~Close hourly production/demand and confirm other gas destinations and storage reference conditions.',
'levelcalib':'核對高程基準並以獨立水位驗證，重新播放感測偏差情境。~Check elevation datum against an independent level and replay the sensor-bias scenario.',
'docload':'重測 DOC 與原水特性，經瓶杯試驗判讀需求而非直接線性投藥。~Remeasure DOC/source properties and assess demand with jar tests rather than direct linear dosing.',
'filterwaste':'以連續水質確認復原，將初濾排放從淨產水扣除。~Confirm recovery with continuous quality and subtract filter-to-waste from net production.',
'load':'先回查濃度基準與流量加權採樣，再重算負荷。~First check the concentration basis and flow-weighted sampling, then recalculate loading.',
'nload':'把各流股氮物種分列，查核高氨回流是否漏算。~Separate nitrogen species for every stream and check for omitted ammonium-rich returns.',
'pload':'重測總磷與溶解磷，將固體分離和水相反應分開診斷。~Remeasure total/dissolved P and diagnose solids separation separately from aqueous reactions.',
'hrt':'用示蹤曲線及有效容積修正假設，先在模擬中比較分流方案。~Revise assumptions using tracing/effective volume and compare flow-distribution options in simulation first.',
'shorth':'查分隔牆與旁流，將有效容積重新列入區段模型。~Check baffles and bypass streams and update the compartment effective volume.',
'inventory':'以多位置固體樣本核對庫存，將死區分開建模。~Check inventory with multi-location solids samples and model dead zones separately.',
'fm':'核對可利用有機物與揮發固體基準，再比較負荷配置。~Check bioavailable organics and volatile-solids bases before comparing load allocation.',
'srt':'用實際排出乾固體修正 SRT，分開回流與離開系統的流股。~Correct SRT with actual exported dry solids, separating recycle from system exits.',
'otr':'比對不同位置 DO 與耗氧率，區分需求改變和傳氧退化。~Compare spatial DO and oxygen uptake to separate demand changes from transfer deterioration.',
'denit':'查可利用碳與攜入氧，先核對電子供體收支。~Check available carbon and oxygen carryover, then close the donor balance.',
'sor':'比較分池流量及沉降測試，先評估配流是否失衡。~Compare cell flows and settling tests, first checking distribution imbalance.',
'energy':'配對相同流量與出水品質再比較能耗，列出附屬設備。~Compare energy at matched flow/quality and list auxiliary equipment.',
'nitrite':'用同時段氨與亞硝酸分析校對比例，避免單看一支探頭。~Check ratios using time-matched ammonium/nitrite analysis rather than one probe.',
'pnfrac':'重新閉合氮物種收支，將同化與副反應列成獨立項。~Reclose species balances with assimilation and side reactions separated.',
'nvol':'查有效容積、活性與顆粒流失，再測負荷敏感度。~Check effective volume, activity and granule loss before a loading sensitivity test.',
'pno2':'先分清亞硝化和完全硝化需氧，核對生成的氮物種。~Separate nitritation from complete-nitrification demand and check products.',
'fa':'校正 pH 與溫度後重算，將抑制判斷留給相符的活性試驗。~Recalculate after pH/temperature calibration and assess inhibition with matched activity tests.',
'monod':'增加低高濃度測點檢查模型，不把飽和模型外插到抑制區。~Add low/high substrate observations without extrapolating saturation models into inhibition.',
'nbalance':'另外測固體及其他氮途徑，保留未閉合殘差。~Measure solids and other N pathways and retain the unclosed residual.',
'nito2':'分列有機與硝化需氧，用氮轉化量交叉核對。~Separate carbonaceous/nitrification demand and cross-check N conversion.',
'alk':'以鹼度滴定及氮轉化量查緩衝收支，不只調整 pH 顯示值。~Check buffering with alkalinity titration and N conversion, not just displayed pH.',
'alkrec':'將實際反硝化量和鹼度回復配對，保留進流緩衝項。~Pair actual denitrification with recovered alkalinity and retain influent buffering.',
'recycle':'量支線流量及 DO，離線比較回流與攜氧折衷。~Measure branch flow/DO and compare recycle/oxygen-carryover trade-offs offline.',
'calib':'清潔並依方法校正感測器，以獨立檢查點驗證。~Clean/calibrate by the relevant method and verify using an independent point.',
'mix':'核對兩股流量及同成分分析，避免以簡單平均混合。~Check both flows and same-species analyses rather than arithmetic averaging.',
'theta':'改用符合溫度區間的實驗資料，重跑低溫情境。~Use observations appropriate to the temperature range and replay cold conditions.',
'codp':'分析 VFA 及可快速分解 COD，區分可利用比例。~Analyze VFA/readily biodegradable COD to distinguish availability.',
'prelease':'按水力延遲配對採樣，檢查硝酸鹽和氧入侵。~Pair samples by hydraulic lag and check nitrate/oxygen intrusion.',
'puptake':'把吸磷與含磷排泥一起檢查，不只比水相濃度。~Check uptake together with P-rich wasting, not aqueous concentration alone.',
'pwaste':'重算乾固體與乾基含磷率，將濕重和元素質量分開。~Recalculate dry solids and dry-basis P content separately from wet mass.',
'partp':'比較過濾前後磷與 TSS，優先診斷固體逃逸。~Compare filtered/unfiltered P and TSS, first diagnosing solids escape.',
'femolar':'校對元素莫耳與藥品成分，再用平行瓶杯驗證。~Check elemental moles and reagent composition, then use parallel jar tests.',
'dose':'核對活性成分、流量和投加量換算，避免把示例作為推薦設定。~Check active strength, flow and dosing conversion; do not use the example as a recommended setting.',
'solution':'重新確認濃度標示、密度與計量泵實測出量。~Reconfirm concentration labeling, density and measured pump delivery.',
'gt':'同時比較絮體破碎、沉降和殘濁，離線修正混合分段。~Compare breakup, settling and residual turbidity while revising mixing stages offline.',
'removal':'配對進出水流量及分析基準，另外確認轉化產物。~Match inlet/outlet flow and analysis bases and check transformation products separately.',
'residual':'補列回流、庫存與採樣不確定度，保留無法解釋的差額。~Add recycle, inventory and sampling uncertainty, retaining unexplained differences.',
'olr':'查 VS 進料與有效槽容，將酸鹼及產氣趨勢一同判讀。~Check VS feed/effective volume together with acidity and gas trends.',
'dgtime':'查沉積與浮渣占據空間，重估有效停留。~Check volume lost to deposits/scum and re-estimate effective residence.',
'vsdestroy':'以體積、乾固體及 VS 分率重建進出質量。~Rebuild inlet/outlet masses from volume, dry solids and VS fraction.',
'methane':'把氣體標準狀態與甲烷比例校正，另列溶解和漏失項。~Normalize gas conditions/methane fraction and separately list dissolved and leakage losses.',
'vfaalk':'用相同分析法追蹤時間序列，對照進料、產氣及 pH。~Track a same-method time series against feed, gas and pH.',
'heat':'更新進料量、含水率和溫度，再核對熱損及回收。~Update feed, moisture and temperature and check heat loss/recovery.',
'gasenergy':'確認甲烷體積及熱值基準，分開發電、回熱與自用。~Confirm methane volume/heating-value bases and separate electricity, heat and internal demand.',
'feedsolids':'用代表性含固樣本重算乾量，避免濕重混用。~Recalculate dry mass from representative solids samples, without mixing wet mass.',
'cake':'同步量乾固體與泥餅重量，查固體回收率是否變化。~Measure dry solids and wet cake together and check capture changes.',
'capture':'重新量進料、濾液及泥餅固體，查回流水漏項。~Remeasure feed, filtrate and cake solids and check omitted returns.',
'polymer':'校核有效聚合物乾基，將藥耗與泥餅及濾液表現比較。~Check active polymer on a dry-solids basis and compare consumption with cake/filtrate performance.',
'returnn':'將側流量與氨氮同步採樣，納入主流水線負荷。~Sample sidestream flow/ammonium synchronously and include them in mainstream load.',
'thpheat':'補列熱損、回熱與物性，不以此式設定壓力容器。~Add losses, heat recovery and material properties; do not use this equation to set a pressure vessel.',
'recoverheat':'核對熱源與熱需求溫位，避免把低溫回熱全算可用。~Check source/demand temperature grades before counting recovered heat as usable.',
'steam':'採用一致蒸汽及冷凝水熱焓基準，關閉能量收支。~Use consistent steam/condensate enthalpy bases and close the energy balance.',
'batchcap':'把清洗、停機與不完整批次明列，再調整排程。~List cleaning, downtime and incomplete batches before revising the schedule.',
'rcf':'核對有效半徑、轉速及振動證據，實機設定依核准設備文件。~Check effective radius, speed and vibration evidence; equipment settings follow approved documents.',
'diffspeed':'將相對速度和扭矩、固體負荷及泥餅一併比較。~Compare differential speed with torque, solids loading and cake condition.',
'beltload':'重新量在線帶寬及乾固體量，排查邊緣偏料。~Remeasure active width/dry-solids load and check uneven edge feeding.',
'beltcontact':'以實際速度和有效長度重算，配對濾液及泥餅資料。~Recalculate with actual speed/effective length and pair with filtrate/cake data.',
'evap':'先由乾固體收支確認需去除水量，再比較熱負荷。~Confirm water removal through the dry-solids balance before comparing heat demand.',
'latent':'另加顯熱與熱損，避免潛熱單項被當總能源。~Add sensible heat and losses rather than treating latent heat as total energy.',
'dryersec':'同步量實際蒸發水及整套熱輸入，核對相同邊界。~Measure actual evaporation and whole-system heat input at the same boundary.',
'methanefrac':'以溫壓一致的甲烷組成分析重算，確認乾濕基準。~Recalculate from same-condition methane analysis and verify wet/dry basis.',
'gasloss':'補測尾氣與溶解甲烷，區分產品純度和回收率。~Measure tail-gas/dissolved methane and distinguish purity from recovery.',
'adsorb':'加密床前後取樣與累積負荷圖，確認穿透而非只按日曆。~Increase bed inlet/outlet sampling and cumulative-load tracking instead of calendar-only replacement.',
'dew':'另測露點與含濕，檢查排水及下游相容性。~Measure dew point/moisture separately and check drainage/downstream compatibility.',
'chpnet':'核對每個附屬電表與能源邊界，分列熱能和電能。~Check auxiliary meters/energy boundaries and separate heat from electricity.',
'alpha':'由污水條件與實測傳氧辨識係數，查曝氣器污堵。~Identify the coefficient using wastewater transfer measurements and inspect diffuser fouling.',
'airreq':'更新氧需求與實測傳氧效率，核對配氣均勻性。~Update oxygen demand/measured transfer efficiency and check air distribution.',
'power':'配對流量、揚程、轉速與電表，再比較工作點。~Match flow, head, speed and electricity before comparing duty points.',
'oxygenenergy':'把氧轉移估算和電力邊界對齊，確認出水品質。~Align oxygen-transfer/electricity boundaries and verify effluent quality.',
'peakratio':'用實際峰值歷線重播，查瞬時水位及下游能力。~Replay actual peak hydrographs and check instantaneous levels/downstream capacity.',
'settle':'用沉降曲線與有效水深核對，檢查短流及再懸浮。~Check settling curves/effective depth and investigate bypass/resuspension.',
'weir':'對照堰高程與沿堰流量，查局部偏流及附著物。~Compare weir elevation/local flow and inspect uneven flow/deposits.',
'solidsload':'把回流及混合液濃度都列入，查分池負荷不均。~Include recycle and mixed-liquor concentration and check cell-load imbalance.',
'svi':'補做完整沉降曲線及顯微觀察，不由 SVI 單點定性。~Add full settling curves/microscopy rather than diagnosing from one SVI value.',
'ras':'將回流濃度、泥毯及出水固體一起檢查。~Check return concentration, blanket and effluent solids together.',
'blanket':'比較多位置泥毯與固體濃度，查進出固體差額。~Compare spatial blanket/solids measurements and check solids imbalance.',
'storage':'累積量測進出流量並核對水位，列入沉積占容。~Integrate measured flows, check level and account for sediment volume.',
'runoff':'改用事件雨量與濕潤條件校正，將峰值歷線另建模。~Calibrate to event rainfall/wetness and model peak hydrographs separately.',
'eventload':'以事件時序流量加權採樣，保留未採到的尖峰不確定度。~Use event flow-weighted sampling and retain uncertainty from unsampled peaks.',
'drawdown':'查持續入流和下游能力，離線比較排空時序。~Check continuing inflow/downstream capacity and compare drawdown timing offline.',
'velocity':'核對實際管徑及流量，查彎頭、纖維與沉積證據。~Check actual diameter/flow and inspect fittings, fibers and deposits.',
'blockarea':'以遠端影像與前後水位確認遮蔽，依維護程序處理。~Verify obstruction using remote images/level difference and follow maintenance procedures.',
'wetwell':'用可用容積與進出流量重算，另看高水位及備援限制。~Recalculate usable volume/inflow/outflow and separately assess high-level/redundancy limits.',
'redundancy':'以共同系統曲線驗證並聯情境，不能只加總銘牌。~Verify parallel scenarios against the shared system curve, not summed nameplates.',
'h2sfrac':'校正水相 pH、溫度及保存方法，另用氣相量測判讀逸散。~Correct aqueous pH, temperature and preservation, using separate gas measurements for release.',
'corrosionrate':'重測同點及鄰近材料厚度，保留局部失效與結構評估。~Remeasure matched/adjacent thickness and retain localized-failure/structural assessment.',
'airchanges':'查實測風量、死角及持續產氣；密閉空間程序不能以此比值取代。~Check airflow, dead zones and continuing generation; the ratio does not replace confined-space procedures.',
'uvdose':'回到反應器驗證資料與流況，避免把均勻場示例作為現場劑量。~Return to reactor-validation/hydraulic data rather than using the uniform-field example as a field dose.',
'uvtrans':'確認波長、光程及空白，再查水質與顆粒變化。~Confirm wavelength, path length and blank, then check water/particle changes.',
'logrem':'核對檢出限及水力配對，對未檢出結果使用可支持的下限。~Check detection limits/hydraulic pairing and use supportable lower bounds for nondetection.',
'lamp':'分別檢查老化、污垢與感測偏差，再依程序驗證恢復。~Check aging, fouling and sensor bias separately and verify recovery by the applicable procedure.',
'ct':'重新配對示蹤 T10 與殘留剖面，不由名義容積推論消毒。~Pair tracer T10 with residual profiles rather than inferring disinfection from nominal volume.',
'ozonemass':'同步校正氣體輸入、尾氣與水相殘留，關閉臭氧收支。~Synchronize/calibrate feed gas, off-gas and aqueous residual and close the ozone balance.',
'decay':'用同原水實測時間序列重擬合，檢查一階模型殘差。~Refit a matched-water time series and inspect first-order-model residuals.',
'mixpower':'查實際傳入水中功率、黏度與死角，觀察絮體而非只看電表。~Check power delivered to water, viscosity and dead zones, observing flocs rather than electricity alone.',
'jar':'重做同批原水平行試驗，分開藥量、剪切與時間的影響。~Repeat parallel tests on one water batch, separating dose, shear and time effects.',
'rate':'扣掉停用面積重算濾速，核對各池流量與水質。~Recalculate using online area and check cell flows/quality.',
'backwash':'比較水溫、床層膨脹與洗出水，依設備驗證範圍評估。~Compare temperature, bed expansion and washwater within validated equipment conditions.',
'expand':'在多處量床高與流失濾料，查配水不均。~Measure bed height/media loss at several positions and check uneven distribution.',
'netwater':'分列毛產水、反洗、初濾排放與回流水，避免重複計數。~Separate gross production, backwash, filter-to-waste and recycle without double-counting.',
'slowrate':'以成熟且在線的實際面積核算，維護時重新比較負荷。~Use actually mature, online area and reassess loading during maintenance.',
'poretime':'核對孔隙率、砂深及示蹤分布，另驗證生物成熟。~Check porosity, sand depth and tracer distribution and verify maturity separately.',
'scrape':'逐次記錄刮砂及剩餘深度，以水質證據判讀復原。~Record each scraping/remaining depth and assess recovery using quality evidence.',
'ebct':'確認使用總床體積定義，將短流與傳質效果另驗證。~Confirm the bulk-bed-volume definition and validate bypass/mass transfer separately.',
'bedvol':'同步畫累積床體積與污染質量，不只比較運轉日數。~Plot cumulative bed volumes and contaminant mass together, not runtime alone.',
'breakthrough':'檢查床前後同時採樣與檢出限，沿時間建立穿透曲線。~Check simultaneous bed samples/detection limits and build a time-based breakthrough curve.',
'carboncap':'用中試動態容量及競爭水質校正，規劃穿透前後的採樣。~Refine with pilot dynamic capacity/competing water quality and plan breakthrough sampling.',
'flux':'改用在線有效面積重算，配對反洗停機與淨產水。~Recalculate using online effective area and account for washing downtime/net output.',
'tmp':'校正三個壓力點及高程，確認所用膜流道定義。~Calibrate the three pressure points/elevations and confirm membrane-flow configuration.',
'perm':'配對溫度與 TMP，再區分可逆污染及不可逆變化。~Match temperature/TMP before separating reversible fouling from irreversible change.',
'recovery':'重新關閉三流股水量，檢查濃水條件與後段風險。~Reclose the three-stream water balance and check concentrate/downstream conditions.',
'rejection':'確認同成分及同溫基準，將鹽透過和水回收率分開。~Check same-species/temperature bases and separate salt passage from water recovery.',
'concentrate':'將三流股流量與離子分析配對，列出沉澱或漏算流股。~Pair three-stream flows/ion analysis and list precipitation or omitted streams.',
'ndp':'更新壓差和鹽度對應的滲透壓差，再分析通量變化。~Update hydraulic/osmotic pressure differences before interpreting flux changes.',
'cleanrecovery':'把恢復通透率與截留或完整性證據一起判讀。~Interpret recovered permeability alongside rejection or integrity evidence.',
'sulfload':'核對保存、氧化及揮發損失，重新建立硫質量基準。~Check preservation, oxidation and volatilization losses and rebuild the sulfur basis.',
'gasload':'統一溫壓與成分單位，再配對風量與濃度。~Unify temperature/pressure and composition units before pairing flow/concentration.',
'gasbreak':'同步測入口與出口氣體成分，另檢查環境暴露監測。~Measure matching inlet/outlet gases and separately check ambient-exposure monitoring.',
'pumpdecline':'以相同揚程轉速重新比較，讓合格人員依隔離程序檢查。~Compare at matched head/speed and have qualified staff inspect under isolation procedures.',
'surfacecoverage':'補上遮蔽及未測區域，避免以部分影像推定全線完好。~Add occluded/unmeasured regions rather than inferring whole-line condition from partial images.',
'uvtime':'用水位與示蹤查短流，核對流量是否仍在驗證範圍。~Check bypass using level/tracing and verify flow remains within the validated range.',
'indicatorload':'確認微生物方法及檢出限，與同時段流量配對。~Confirm microbial method/detection limit and pair with matched-period flow.',
'byproduct':'以中試分析取代假想比例，同時追蹤前驅物及產物。~Replace the hypothetical fraction with pilot analysis, tracking precursor and product together.',
'dgstock':'比較多深度固體與溫度，將沉積死區納入模型。~Compare depth-resolved solids/temperature and include deposited dead zones.',
'dewaterenergy':'核對乾固體處理量及主機附屬電力，配對泥餅與回收率。~Check dry-solids throughput and machine/auxiliary electricity alongside cake and capture.',
'beltwater':'獨立量沖洗用水和回流負荷，確認噴嘴及濾帶狀態。~Meter wash water and return loads separately and inspect nozzles/belt condition.',
'filterhead':'比較分層測壓、流量與水溫，區分堵塞與流量變化。~Compare multi-level heads, flow and temperature to distinguish clogging from changed flow.',
'filterpore':'核對有效床深、孔隙估計與旁流，另外量出水顆粒。~Check effective depth, porosity estimate and bypass, measuring effluent particles separately.',
'filterrun':'把終點水質、停洗及初濾損失一併列入可用產水。~Include endpoint quality, wash downtime and filter-to-waste in usable output.',
'sandvolume':'多點量實際砂深，另列承托層、孔隙與施工餘量。~Measure sand depth at several positions and separately list support layers, voids and construction allowances.',
'grading':'查完整篩分析曲線與材料一致性，不能只比 UC。~Check the full sieve curve and consistency rather than UC alone.',
'slowhead':'使用多層測壓區分表層生物膜與深床阻力。~Use multi-level piezometry to separate surface-biofilm from deep-bed resistance.',
'freundlich':'補測競爭背景與不同濃度，將平衡容量和動態壽命分開。~Add competing-background/concentration tests and separate equilibrium capacity from dynamic life.',
'gacload':'核對微克換算與流量加權濃度，保留分析空白。~Check microgram conversion and flow-weighted concentration, retaining analytical blanks.',
'leaktest':'依核准方法排除溫度和配管洩漏，再評估膜完整性。~Rule out temperature/plumbing leakage by the approved method before assessing membrane integrity.',
'ufnet':'以分支水表和槽位重建每日收支，避免回收重複計入。~Rebuild the daily balance from branch meters/tank levels without double-counting recycle.',
'roenergy':'以實測壓差、流量及電表核對效率，分列附屬與回收能源。~Check efficiency with measured pressure, flow and power, separating auxiliaries and recovered energy.',
'concfactor':'改用各離子質量與飽和分析，另估膜面濃差極化。~Use ion balances/saturation analysis and separately estimate membrane-surface polarization.',
'saltflux':'補做離子分析及流量配對，不將電導率無條件換成鹽質量。~Add ion analysis and matched flow, avoiding unconditional conductivity-to-salt conversion.',
'normflux':'依膜型核准方法完整正規化，保存原始溫度、壓力與鹽度。~Normalize fully using the membrane-approved method and retain raw temperature, pressure and salinity.'
}
for _n,_f,_s,_rows,_nodes in COURSES:
    for _i,_row in enumerate(_rows):
        _title,_mechanism,_failure,_wrong,_method=_row
        _fz,_fe=pair(_failure); _rz,_re=pair(RESPONSE[_method])
        _rows[_i]=(_title,_mechanism,f'{_fz}診斷與介入：{_rz}~{_fe} Diagnostic response: {_re}',_wrong,_method)
write_all()
